Show / 6:30 GO. Cost $6\n\nHoneymooners hash. Honeymoon in Cabo Sunset Hash... Hump Me Davidson & Inject-her Gadget are leaving all their worries, stresses, and kids behind and going on their much-awaited Honeymoon to Cabo San Lucas on April 20th! Come see them off... in case you never see them again!! :-P Attire: dress as if you are going on your honeymoon in Cabo... whether it is in a swimsuit, nightie, sundress, sombrero, flip flops and short shorts... Whatever floats your boat!","old_desc_md5":"c6d7eaa2573f490ef7cc44f95121a556"},{"id":"cmpr8hqaa00h0pyhn2gi1zwsz","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Hash Run #1185","old_title_md5":"76e1055042050b37e9d10e1b6476f6af","set_hares":true,"hares":"Purrfurred P, G-String, Vagazzled, Hump Me Davidson","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Hash Run #1185. Hares: Purrfurred P, G-String, Vagazzled, Hump Me Davidson. LOC: The Fly behind Audubon Zoo. 6:00pm Show / 6:30 GO. Cost $6\n\nG-String's Hash Bachelorette Party! Men of course are welcome but should dress appropriately (wigs, dresses, male stripper, etc...)\nhttp://www.yelp.com/map/the-fly-new-orleans","old_desc_md5":"bcf2f2b77c005aa8d89a804eb6be6a4e"},{"id":"cmpr8hrbm00h8pyhn1r8a7pn6","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Hash Run #1186","old_title_md5":"622226691fc22af35e071295c0bee2fa","set_hares":true,"hares":"Bleeding Paloma & High Beams","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Hash Run #1186. Hares: Bleeding Paloma & High Beams. LOC: Gernon Brown Gym on the corner of Harrison ave. and Marconi dr. next to the stop light 6:00pm Show / 6:30 GO. Cost $6","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8hrs100hcpyhnj74gpmwb","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Hash Run #1187 – Cinco de Hasho","old_title_md5":"a74a796433a57c42e2646d68079783bf","set_hares":true,"hares":"Hump Me Davidson, Came Upon Me, & 2 virgin hares Just Christine & Just Martie","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Hash Run #1187. Cinco de Hasho! Hares: Hump Me Davidson, Came Upon 