true,"description":"NOH3 Social...End of Summer SPLASH HASH!!! Hosted by Head First.Meet at 6:00PM at the home of Head First, near the corner of Louisville St. and Lane St. in Lakeview.The Hash will provide one keg and some Jambalaya. Feel free to bring food to share and extra cocktails.BY THE WAY...The Grill Will NOT be available.. Cook at Home.Details to follow.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8k48q00ztpyhnmeeb6mno","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1312 – The Epic Hash","old_title_md5":"4a8f707ca9ab5daa64197c0ed51e1dbd","set_hares":true,"hares":"Snatch Shot","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run # 1312.....The Epic Hash... Bring your Sword and Be Prepared..but the Hares won't say what to be prepared for!! Hares: Snatch Shot, Beer Hare..Came Upon Me, Food Hare..Why Does It Burn..Meet at the corner of Mandeville and N. Peters, 2 blocks off of Elysian Feilds,Time: 4:00PM Show, 4:30 Go..Cost $6.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8k4cr00zvpyhnx3lbkdnd","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – NOH3 Goes to Gretna Fest","old_title_md5":"353bd46c238c7791e44182df4b155525","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social...NOH3 Goes to Gretna Fest !!! Music, Food, Beer!..$20.00 Admission By the Gretna Court House. Meet in the German Beer Garden.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8k4qo00zxpyhnn1n1kjsd","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1313","old_title_md5":"4b5865eea570fde1d2602d048e334a27","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run # 1313: Hares: Only Oral, Puppy Pumper, Came Upon Me (beer), No Strings Attached (food): Where: Corner of Dublin and Hampson Street, two blocks from Cooter Brown's: When: 5.45 Show 6.15 Go..Cost: This will be a $6 Hash..This will be a photo hash since you loved our last one so much.Because it is the first trail since NOH3 turned 25, Puppy Pumper will be giving away some of the hash T-Shirts he has collected over many of those years.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8k4z200zzpyhn8ksqlv0t","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social","o