0 hash...On On","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8k5xe0107pyhncjgdg33t","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – Halloween Movie Night","old_title_md5":"1a179ff7f44cfb1319d9c4fd6b8c8b57","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social..Halloween Movie Night...Meet at Tarpon Joe's, 2205 David Dr...6:00 PM to socialize and have Cocktails and maybe Dinner..Then the Movies, \"The Exorcist\" at 8:00PM and \"Halloween\" at 10:00PM. Bring your own folding chair.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8k6b70109pyhntsk61s74","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1316 – The All Harriette","old_title_md5":"c6798f2c78646638ca60bdfe3e84b93a","set_hares":true,"hares":"Size Matters, Kneez to Pleez and Lick the Lid","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run # 1316...The All Harriette Hare Hash !!! Hares: Size Matters, Kneez to Pleez and Lick the Lid...Meet at 1525 Airline Drive, Corner of Airline at Ridgewood. Side of AMC Distributors.10:00AM Show, 10:30 Go..Wear your Saints gear or Halloween Costume..This will be a $5.00 Hash. ON ON IN to Deutches Haus for the Saints Game where food will be available.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8k6g9010bpyhn0zexw4w2","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – Molly's Halloween Parade","old_title_md5":"b6a30500d0ec9184b6640d291ebcb537","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social...Molly's Halloween Parade. 6:00 PM...1107 Decatur St. Rolls at 6:30.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8k6pn010fpyhns6vj2std","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1317","old_title_md5":"b0083d1753787b566aeaac2baa8c3abf","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1317..A full day of Saints Football and HashingMeet at the home of Head First at 11:00AM for Saints Football (Noon Kickoff)Ask a hasher if you don't know where Head First lives.For the Game: Bring your own cocktails and Food to share.The grill will NOT be open.The Run: Meet in front of Head First's Home..Hares...Bearly Blue and Head First..4:00PM Show4:30 Go..Cost:...$6.00 Bring Whistles and Flashlights(First day