 1:30 at Tarpon Joe's, 2205 David Dr....OR Stay Home and Rest! Save yourself for the Highlander Ball Tomorrow Night!!!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8k8aj010tpyhn4fjthokg","set_title":true,"title":"Highlander Ball – Venue","old_title_md5":"5e29bd042cfb4cae214bfaa19ccaded3","set_desc":true,"description":"Highlander Ball!!! Venue:Tarpon Joe's 2205 David Dr...Come one come all to the 2nd annual Highlander Ball. Party with the Celtic Highlanders. Kilts are preferred but wearing of the green is acceptable. Music will be by our own Minister of Highlander Ball music, Sir Jorge. It will be $10 entry and include Beer, and food. Invite your friends. More info soon. Since this a \"Ball\" albeit a rather low class ball, thrift shop ball gowns are appropriate. Food donations are welcome.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8k8mz010vpyhnxkrzk22l","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1321","old_title_md5":"193bb143891b7c6b69a6c3104a66684a","set_hares":true,"hares":"Ready Whip, Uranus and","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1321..A Hash Run, A Hash Birthday And a Hash House Warming!!!..Hares:Ready Whip, Uranus and Beer Hare..Came Upon Me...Meet at Moe's Corner Bar, 5201 4th St. at the corner of \"I\" St. in Marrero. I smell Birthday Cake in the Circle!!! And the on in to the New Home of Ready and Uranus...Noon Show and 12:30 Go!! This will be a $6.00 hHash","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8k8xk010xpyhnh3muvw5a","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Christmas Party – Dirty Santa, if you want to","old_title_md5":"cc0c37dc6e33dd301695380c841e1a02","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Christmas Party..8-12 pm at New Orleans Yacht Club. $10 at the door. Includes food, open bar for three hours with beer, wine and mixed drinks. Dirty Santa, if you want to - bring a gift, price range $15 to exchange, or you can make or steal something - asking everyone to put it in a gift bag so we can open them faster. Party attire. Hope to see you all there.\n\n8-12 pm $10 at the door. Includes food, open bar for three hours with beer, wine and mixed drinks. Dirty Santa, if you want to - bring a gift, price range $15 to exchange, or you can make or steal something - asking everyone to put it in a gift bag so we can open them faster. Party attire. Hope to see you all there.","old_desc_md5":"8a8db0848dfe913b7a01717a5111dc20"},{"id":"cmpr8k97e0111pyhnq47s5seq","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1322 – Saints Tailgate Hash!!","old_title_md5":"b8da3a3a1bd96ffe1b1b2a25628414a3","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run # 1322 .. Saints Tailgate Hash!!...Came Upon Me ,Lil' Red Head and We'd Eat Her...Meet at the corner of Julia and O'Keefe...1:00PM Show, 3:00 PM GO!!!...Cost...$6.00","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8k9bo0113pyhnjdcclkuw","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – Tarpon Joe's Christmas Party","old_title_md5":"adcf2c09626fdacd3b69b3136d39addf","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social...Tarpon Joe's Christmas Party!! The Hash will provide a KEG! 2205 David Drive, 7:00 PM","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8k9mx0117pyhn74tlsole","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run 1323 – Birthday Hash!","old_title_md5":"735094e08b0d0ced8a734e00492349ae","set_hares":true,"hares":"..Puppy Pumper, Kneeze to Pleeze and Gooey Blow(food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run 1323... Birthday Hash!...Hares:..Puppy Pumper, Kneeze to Pleeze and Gooey Blow(food) ..We need a Beer Hare Please!..Meet at West Metairie Plaza, 5928 West Metairie Ave...12:30 PM Show..1:00 PM Go..This is a $6.00 Hash..We will watch the Saints Game after Trail at 3:25","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8k9sc0119pyhnxe1bw8rp","set_title":true,"title":"Noh3 Social – Tulane Green Wave Happy Hour at Manning's","old_title_md5":"9fc25e76db08dabb0452c3c3171f6118","set_desc":true,"description":"Noh3 Social...Tulane Green Wave Happy Hour at Manning's ,Time: 4:00 - 6:00PM, Location: Manning's Restaurant, 519 Fulton St... Cost: Free .. happy hour from 4pm to 6pm for special food and drink discounts.hen \"Second-Line\" with the Tulane Marching Band and Cheerleaders to the Friday night free concert in Champions Square. Time: 7:00 p.m.Cost: Free..Charlie Daniels Band / Travis Tritt","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8k9zn011bpyhn30igy8c0","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1324","old_title_md5":"8e91f8c0e910f17fad724a5067a5ab6b","set_hares":true,"hares":"Bend Over Rover","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run # 1324 .. Hares: Bend Over Rover...Meet near Finn Mc Cool's..Banks St. and Telemachus St....10:30 AM Show, 11:00 AM Go...This will be a $5.00 or $6.00 Hash...Then On IN for a Private Viewing of the Saints Game!!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8kact011fpyhnu20jve68","set_title":true,"title":"Tour de Liquor","old_title_md5":"a9a9c66f9cabec56aaf1d47c1df328db","set_desc":true,"description":"Tour de Liquor..Meet at Parlay's 870 Harrison Ave at 9:00 AM..Roll at 10:30..Details on Facebook. NOH3 Social..Join us after the Tour at Parlay's...5:00PM.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8kapj011hpyhno5arxhcn","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1325","old_title_md5":"ac56fc55e4a4536967eafd72eb65edef","set_hares":true,"hares":"Barely Blue and Cam UponMe","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run # 1325:..Hares: Barely Blue and Cam UponMe..Meet at the HashTailgate Lot on the corner of O'Keefe and Julia..11:30 Show, Noon Go. $6.00 for the Hash, BUT for an extra $4.00 the Hares will have Oysters for us after the run If you want to participate.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8kauc011jpyhn20911f7b","set_title":true,"title":"New Year's Eve","old_title_md5":"17ca15dc49b09f86b326be8be447ca53","set_desc":true,"description":"New Year's Eve - come celebrate at Tarpon Joe's, 2205 David Dr., Came Upon Me is gonna put out some kegs, lots of food, crank up some music, and dance into 2014. $10 will get you all the beer you can drink, black eyed peas for luck, cabbage for money, and pork just cuz it tastes so good.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8kbb4011ppyhn9hcho5l7","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social","old_title_md5":"eeea60bdabf7c14b2986b7096dbb377a","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social...Join us to Watch the Saints take on the Eagles in the first round of the NFC Payoffs. Meet at 7:00 PM at the home of Head First (ask if you don't know where she lives). Bring your choice of beverage and some kind of food to share. ON ON","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8kbnk011rpyhnzwamthro","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1326 – KING'S DAY HASH","old_title_md5":"557da69b66febf0d9359f4a619de5bdb","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run # 1326..KING'S DAY HASH: Some people say that the first hash of the New Year is always the best. What we can tell you is that it is our King's Day Hash, and while we are hashing on the 11th day of Christmas this year, we are still going to be kicking off Mardi Gras season right. Bring your Mardi Gras costumes, your beads, your boobies and your glitter. I will be taking care of food and trail. Could use some help if someone wants to jump in and beer hare. 1:30 show and 2 pm go from Elysian Fields side of Washington Square","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8kc0e011vpyhndzyyzd6e","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – Who Dat","old_title_md5":"0bd0d40ba9037e7d1e07dfff81199d67","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social! Who Dat!!! NOH3 Loves the Saints. Deutsches Haus: 3pm; Saints game versus Seattle. 1023 Ridgewood Dr., Metairie, LA","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8kcc6011xpyhnxr2e6yi5","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1327","old_title_md5":"dbfe13bb352faf2a82c5428e2f354348","set_hares":true,"hares":"Penis Colada and a Mystery Hare","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run # 1327..Hares: Penis Colada and a Mystery Hare...Food Hare is Why Does It Burn and Beer Hare TBA..Meet in the parking lot of Orleans Super Home Center in Harvey on the west bank. 3407 Lapalco Blvd. Possibility Of Shiggy. 1:30PM Show, 2:00PM Go..This will be a $6.00 Hash.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8kcla011zpyhnp1v2q4j7","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – Join us at the ABITA Pub Crawl","old_title_md5":"299141659631c5a66de931d876493cd5","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social..Join us at the ABITA Pub Crawl. Meet at Howlin' Wolf, 907 South Peters St. at 5:00PM ...More info here: http://abita.com/party/pub_crawls/","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8kcqd0121pyhnk1tvpvuy","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1328 – The Martin Luther King Birthday Hash","old_title_md5":"810f3b159b3325ea5ac0ebf43744ae2c","set_hares":true,"hares":"Came Upon Me, Only Oral and Pap Smear","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run # 1328...The Martin Luther King Birthday Hash....NOH3 Run #1328, I Have a Dream Hash, Hares: Came Upon Me, Only Oral and Pap Smear, Meet at the parking lot under Pontchartrain Expressway at S Rampart & Caliope, 1:00 Geaux/1:30 Geaux, $6 hash","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8kczc0123pyhnppc7ogoz","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social @ the Pearl Wine Co","old_title_md5":"293e919a73aaac03f1e977f83b018a2b","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social...Meet at the Pearl Wine Co. in the American Can Building, 3700 Orleans Ave. 6:00 PM","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8kd980125pyhna0fszu9e","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1329 The Samosa Hash at The Log Cabin","old_title_md5":"24e38e741afe5a50d080f712eb472466","set_hares":true,"hares":"Goes Down to the Last Drop and Wrong Hole","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run # 1329 The Samosa Hash at The Log Cabin...Hares: Goes Down to the Last Drop and Wrong Hole..25 Acres of Trail. And The Best Home Grown Citrus juice in 'Da Parish. Besides Beer we'll have Samosas(Champagne and Satsuma juice) and Mimosas. There is Plenty of Juice but if you can bring a bottle of Champagne to share that would be Great!(No Top Shelf Bubbly).Meet at 1332 Bayou Rd,St Bernard..1:00PM Show,1:30 Go. Cost.$6.00.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8kdkl0127pyhng8fmu7b