gers will steal your soles...What to wear: Wear red...Virgin Hare, Just Ruth, With Scouts On Her, Beer Hare is Jizz Rag and Food hare is Banging and Entering.. ..Location:The roof top at Thalia St. and Annunciation....Time1:30PM Show, 2:00PM G: ...Cost: $6.00","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8l922018zpyhncvr9hy26","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – a large selection of Wine & Beer","old_title_md5":"c7bfd083cb229b40bd0bcf730e8e7381","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social...The Pearl Wine Bar, 3700 Orleans Avenue #1c, New Orleans, LA 70119 In the American Can Building... a large selection of Wine & Beer...6:00 PM","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8l9bk0191pyhn1myc6nt2","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1381 Rock N Roll Marathon If you want to sign up for the…","old_title_md5":"0927bc7d9176c9585d0ddfbad1a6c395","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run # 1381 Rock N Roll Marathon If you want to sign up for the RnR Marathon Water Stop here is the site. You don't have to sign up, they extract a lot of info from you. You will still get the swag without signing up. But if you want to hash for $1 you need to show up and work before 7:00 AM, Sunday January 25th at the corner of N. Peters and Barracks. Don't work and you pay full price! Great Food and Beer all day! And when the work slows down your Hares will be No Time for Pussy and Lick the Lid","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8l9l40193pyhnhpjkkbwe","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – NOH3 Brings the FUN!","old_title_md5":"e551dba9f6f6c7ada9103d8720686250","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Marie's Bar, 2483 Burgundy Street, New Orleans, LA 70117...NOH3 Brings the FUN!..Inexpensive Beer...Good Times...6:00PM.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8l9pc0195pyhn8bhw0fb5","set_title":true,"title":"Cupid's Underwear Run – You are invited","old_title_md5":"a4662c7c0ae52ca9ec9da080716db59a","set_desc":true,"description":"Cupid's Underwear Run! You are invited! Come help this greagt cause!.. http://www.cupidsundierun.com/city/new-orleans/","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8la4s0199pyhnugkybc3m","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1382 – Super Bowl Hash","old_title_md5":"3d4596618122ce346d6c930ee8fa4a65","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1382... Super Bowl Hash... Hare Piston Penis.., 2:30 Show, 3:00 Go... Meet at Wally Pontiff Playground (Metairie Playground) At the Shelter behind the track (Look for the Beer Truck) Cost....$5.00....///... And Then On On On to Tarpon Joes for the Super Bowl","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8lady019bpyhn2pn92q39","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social","old_title_md5":"e4e627b1e185f6a003eefa9a0bb20002","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social...Meet the Hashers for PEE-RADES..at the Blind Pelican ..1628 Saint Charles Avenue, New Orleans, LA 70130, First parade rolls at 6:00 PM... Be there EARLY!...Krewes Oshun and Cleopatra!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8lard019dpyhn0lx47n5m","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1383 – The Barkus Parade Run","old_title_md5":"426d9f7997ddeda06b68160e821e7f9c","set_hares":true,"hares":"Came Upon Me","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1383..The Barkus Parade Run.. Hare: Came Upon Me...Meet At...1401 Lafitte Avenue, Near Basin @ Treme across from the Municiple Aditorium ( Can you say Red Dress Run?) ....Time:...12:00 Show/12:30 Go...Cost:...$6.00\n\nNOH3 Goes to the DAWGS. If you can't run with us, stay yo butt on da porch.\n\nWe'll be running along the parade route for Krewe of Barkus. Trail will be truly \"shitty\"","old_desc_md5":"cd40c55de058cf531d6ca4ec70c0b24e"},{"id":"cmpr8lb0i019fpyhn7pw8p9ad","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Mardi Gras Madness Pre-Lube and Midnight Run","old_title_md5":"048a1348164bc53455449d4ef973ffa1","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Mardi Gras Madness Pre-Lube and Midnight Run!!! MGM Pre-lube and Midnight Hash ending in the French Quarter....Meet at the Rusty Nail... Pre-lube at 5:00PM, Midnight Hash Run/PubCrawl from the Rusty Nail...$15 includes Beer, Scattered Jello Shots, and Dinner!!!!\n\n5:00PM SHEAUX/ Midnight GEAUX. That's right.....we'll be prelubing for 7 hours, so wear your big girl panties. Prelube is at Rusty Nail. $15 hash.","old_desc_md5":"4156fa3a21fdcdc34278ef36cbee905b"},{"id":"cmpr8lb5p019hpyhnpaqekz4v","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Mardi Gras Madness Costume Run!! – MGM Costume Contest and NOH3 Run #1384","old_title_md5":"cba749773b4e4d4e06509c238279e071","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Mardi Gras Madness Costume Run!!..MGM Costume Contest and NOH3 Run # 1384 ...Meet at Duncan Plaza. 10:00 Show / 11:00 Costume Contest / 12:00 Go. On after for the parades. $20 includes Beer, Scatterd Jello Shots, Lunch, and the MGM 2015 Patch.\n\nDay 2, the Saga Continues: 10:00AM show. Costume contest at 11:00. 12:00 Go. Parade watching for the on after.\n\nAwards for the best Hare costume and best Harriette constume. Also awards for the best group costume of 4.\n\nThis is a $20 hash with lots of beer, lots of food, more beer, a MGM patch, purple green and gold jello shots, and all the grabassery you can handle.","old_desc_md5":"adabcd78fb8404e06145969d5d36cc77"},{"id":"cmpr8lbau019jpyhn9nv9mc10","set_run":true,"run_number":null,"old_run":1384},{"id":"cmpr8lbjm019npyhno1ay985r","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 First Social in Lent @ Tarpon Joe’s 2205 David Dr","old_title_md5":"ca790db57ca8b1cdfa662889226bf178","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 First Social in Lent Meet at Tarpon Joe’s 2205 David Dr., Metairie, LA 70003 6:00PM Give up Bad Beer and Lousy Bar Food for Lent! Come to TJ’s and get the Good Stuff!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8lbsm019ppyhnn4ofa06h","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1385 – The Mimosa Hash at The Log Cabin","old_title_md5":"8aff081552a74489551e050c8324fcee","set_hares":true,"hares":"Goes Down to the Last Drop and Wrong Hole","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run3 #1385... The Mimosa Hash at The Log Cabin...Hares: Goes Down to the Last Drop and Wr