ething so heating doesn’t take so long. This will be a $6.00 Hash If you bring a real dish to share. (Chips and dips don’t count.) If you choose not to bring a dish to share the cost is $15.00... NOH3 is providing Turkey Bird.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8lxwi01ehpyhn4v9i91xw","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social @ Finn McCool’s","old_title_md5":"9943288ec6123d413d2fea96e73a57af","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Meet at Finn McCool’s., 3701 Banks St. At 5:00 pm or after work. Great Beer and Food but With Hashers the Company is just OK.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8ly4801ejpyhnc41kxnf2","set_title":true,"title":"Hash Run #1425","old_title_md5":"b0e124aff092a92f86a4b50ebc98d535","set_hares":true,"hares":"Lil’ Red Head and Came Upon Me, Hashers","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"Hash Run # 1425, Hares: Lil’ Red Head and Came Upon Me, Hashers Meet at Tarpon Joe’s. 2205 David Drive. 10:00 AM Show, 10:30 AM Go. Food at Halftime of Saints Game inside T.J.’s This will be a $6.00 Hash.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8lygz01elpyhnnxvh2k35","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Christmas Party Friday December 4, An NOH3 Dressy Event","old_title_md5":"4bb1bc43c95a5b7d919b94df2eba87b4","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Christmas Party Friday December 4, An NOH3 Dressy Event! (As in, Geez, I didn’t recognize you with clothes on!) New Orleans Yacht Club, 403 N Roadway St. in West End, 8:00 PM until 11:00 PM Cost $20.00 (Costs way more to put this event on. Great Deal!) Food Prepared by Mis-Management. Beer and Wine Open Bar. Cash bar for anything else. White Elephant Gift Exchange. Santa Says $15.00 Minimum to participate. (No Cheapskates!) Merry Hashin’ Christmas!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmpr8lz0001eppyhngwxdzrbm","set_title":true,"title":"Hash Run #1426 Forecast 65 degrees/ Sunny Skies/ No Rain","old_title_md5":"a552c6cb0aca84ce9a6f011c85e67caa","set_hares":true,"hares":"CUM-muter and IME","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"descript