0cb555425276b682a","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, February 1st. Meet at 5:00 @ NOLA Cantina (437 Esplanade Ave. @Frenchmen St. New Orleans, LA 70116). They've got great food and drinks, a d hopefully some drink specials for the hashers!\nhttps://nolacantina.com","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10a3s007q07kz95ybobi7","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1591 – The Anti-Superbowl Hash","old_title_md5":"70e5bf34f388cd1ebeccbb0b95bcecd1","set_hares":true,"hares":"Shitty Titties and CUMmuter (trail and beer) & Squirts on Santa (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1591. Sunday, February 3rd. The Anti-Superbowl Hash! Hares: Shitty Titties and CUMmuter (trail and beer) & Squirts on Santa (food). Location: 501 N. Jeff Davis (by the post office next to Bayou St. John). Time: 2:00 show, 2:30 go. Cost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10a4t007s07kzou812388","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – Two events","old_title_md5":"1ab3d023dbd527fa31e3ffe002bd398b","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, February 8th. Two events! Starting off the evening by meeting at the Spotlight Bar and Grill (2925 Harvard Ave, Metairie, LA 70006) to watch Old School play from 6:00-9:00. Then moving over to Twist of Lime (2820 Lime St, Metairie, LA 70006) to watch Remedy play starting at 9:00. $7 cover for Remedy.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10a5y007u07kz4pgt7wp2","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1592 – Hash to follow","old_title_md5":"41a4d19e55cd54443e49e021dd989f8a","set_hares":true,"hares":"Piston Penis","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1592. Sunday, February 10th. Rock 'n Roll Marathon, Red Dress water station! Wear your finest red dress attire and have a blast passing out water to the runners! Hash to follow. Hare: Piston Penis. Location: on Esplanade about 2 blocks on the river side of Broad. Look for folks wearing red dresses. Time: 6:30am. Cost: free if you help with the water station, $6 if you arrive after 9:00am.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10a71007w07kzdyrtcymx","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – Hang out with the Full Moon H3 crowd","old_title_md5":"d243432301370ed1844507f19b8d1bf6","set_hares":true,"hares":"Saved By the Bush","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, February 15th. Hang out with the Full Moon H3 crowd! Here's their info: NOLA Full Moon Hash! Trail# Omega Pi G\nFriday, February 15th, 2019\n7:00 pm show/ 7:30 go! Runners MUST be away at 7:30 pm in order for us to catch some of Krewe Boheme at BN!\nHare: Saved By the Bush Beer hare: Full Moon \"MM\"\nPrelube: Brieux Carre (2115 Decatur Street)\nStart: Washington Square on the Dauphine side of park\nOn after: TBD!\nTrail is NOT dog friendly due to parade!\n$5 will get you a shitty trail, beer & snacks!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10a83007y07kz3e4a6ub7","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social","old_title_md5":"64c87037d9913b508a124e1c62b94cdc","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Saturday, February 16th. Hang out and watch Krewe du Vieux roll through the Marigny! Location: near the back side of the parking lot by Decatur and Spain. Check facebook to find out where the beer truck actually finds parking. Time: The beer truck will get there around 4:00pm, and the parade starts at 6:30. Cost: $10 buy in if you want hash beer.\nhttp://www.kreweduvieux.org/parade.html","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10a91008007kz37iflweh","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1593","old_title_md5":"cc57fdf3a5d38d654485efe39c3f62bc","set_hares":true,"hares":"Sir Yaks Alot (trail and beer and food) and Kill the Kittens First (also food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1593. Sunday, February 17th. 4th ANAL Krewe du Vieux Hangover Hash. Hare: Sir Yaks Alot (trail and beer and food) and Kill the Kittens First (also food). Location: 4604 S. Derbigny St., New Orleans -- It's near the CVS off of Claiborne (GPS can sometimes lie. Don't go to the westbank) Time: 10:00 show, 10:30 go. Cost: $7.\nThere will be orange juice and fixin's for bloody marys. BYO-alcohol for those drinks.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10aa7008207kzb59c7yk3","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – It's Family Gras","old_title_md5":"bb7404ab2f4df82d327e22f96ebacc93","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, February 22nd. It's Family Gras! For those who want to go out a little early, meet at Triple Play (4417 Veterans Memorial Blvd, Metairie, LA 70006) at 4:00. Then head across the street to Family Gras at Clearview Mall (new location this year than in previous years. BVC crossing Vets). Music starts at Family Gras at 5:00pm, and the parade should get there after 9:00pm. Check their website for info on what you can and cannot bring into Family Gras:\nhttps://www.visitjeffersonparish.com/events/festivals/family-gras/rules-and-safety/","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10abk008407kzs903qx6u","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1594 – Barkus Hash --- the hash is going to the dogs","old_title_md5":"1f7f904b5d1379bd38e128fa912e954b","set_hares":true,"hares":"Came Upon Me (trail, food, and beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1594. Barkus Hash --- the hash is going to the dogs! Hares: Came Upon Me (trail, food, and beer). Location: 1401 Lafitte Ave, New Orleans, LA 70112.Time: 11:00 show, 11:30 go. Cost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10ack008607kzx24n8wkd","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Mardi Gras Madness","old_title_md5":"ed831ba3e89b1cec05fd211012135d4d","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Mardi Gras Madness!!!\nDay 1: Friday, March 1st. Meet at the Rusty Nail at 4:00pm. Cost is $15 for just this event or $30 for all three days of Mardi Gras Madness. The cost on this day covers beer and food, but you can always buy cocktails and such at the bar if you want to. We'll hang out in the courtyard at the Rusty Nail for a while, then meander over to the parade route to drink more and catch some beads!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10adn008807kzmok9tdnj","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Mardi Gras Madness – NOH3 Run #1595","old_title_md5":"466f0ec9bc8d138068e55a6d61222f6e","set_hares":true,"hares":"Came Upon Me (trail, food, & beer. #notallheroeswearcapes)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Mardi Gras Madness!!!\nDay 2: Saturday, March 2nd. NOH3 Run #1595\nCost is $15 for just this event or $30 for all three days of Mardi Gras Madness.\nHare: Came Upon Me (trail, food, & beer. #notallheroeswearcapes)\nLocation: Duncan Plaza Time: 10:00 show, 10:30 go.\nThere will be a costume contest during circle, so dress to impress! Following circle, we'll walk to the parade route to catch the parades --- will be standing near Union & St. Charles.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10aeo008a07kzle4xubqi","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Mardi Gras Madness","old_title_md5":"81a00d1a0006b2a8b072f3e5f2a12073","set_hares":true,"hares":"Pink n Fuzzy (trail) & CUM (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Mardi Gras Madness!!!\nDay 3: Sunday, March 3rd.\nCost is $10 for just this event or $30 for all three days of Mardi Gras Madness. The cost for just this day gets you access to the kegs until they run out. Hangover/cant-be-hungover-if-you-don't-stop-drinking trail!\nHare: Pink n Fuzzy (trail) & CUM (beer).\nLocation: near St. Charles & 2nd. Check facebook that morning for an exact location, or walk around a bit until you find hashers and a stripper pole.\nTime: 9:00 show, 9:30 go","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10afm008c07kz5a17qpe1","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – Mardi Gras is over","old_title_md5":"4ed0ab5065d2353d96619caad9f3aa2e","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, March 8th. Mardi Gras is over --- time for St. Patrick's Day! Meet at Ryan's Irish Pub (241 Decatur St, New Orleans, LA 70130) at 6:00pm.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10agp008e07kziqk7jpqp","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1596","old_title_md5":"e8f3615acc358130c0c7ed2edb1594ba","set_hares":true,"hares":"Condom & Saved by the Bush (trail), Weed Eat Her (food), & Only Oral (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1596. Monday, March 11th. Hare: Condom & Saved by the Bush (trail), Weed Eat Her (food), & Only Oral (beer). Location: meet by the Crescent Park elevator (2300 N Peters St, New Orleans, LA 70117). Time: 6:00 show, 6:30 go. $7. Awards will be given out in circle! 🏅","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10aht008g07kzpm4f2uym","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – It's the Molly's Parade","old_title_md5":"49ab77551b27e355b60c59f149595ae8","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, March 15th. It's the Molly's Parade! Wear some green and prepare your liver; St. Patrick's Day weekend is kicking off! Meet at Turtle Bay (1119 Decatur St, New Orleans, LA 70116) starting at 4:00. Happy hour prices for the hashers. Parade starts at 6:00.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10aj3008i07kz14jlhb9a","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1597 – The NOH3 Green Dress Run","old_title_md5":"52256c50de8103e6d826ed39887fbc99","set_hares":true,"hares":"Shitty Titties (trail & beer) & Saved by the Bush (trail), & Snatch Shot (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1597. Sunday, March 17th. The NOH3 Green Dress Run! Hare: Shitty Titties (trail & beer) & Saved by the Bush (trail), & Snatch Shot (food). Location: Library on Metairie Road (2350 Metairie Rd, Metairie, LA 70001). Time: kegs tapped at 9:00, pack away at 10:30. Get there early if you want a shot a decent parking. Cost: $10\nThe St. Patrick's Day Metairie Rd. parade starts at noon.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10ak3008k07kzgqyb0vz1","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – Hang out at Kajuns and the Full Moon Hash","old_title_md5":"4454db3378b76960f62a5c972a977c64","set_hares":true,"hares":"Whordini & Woody Poke Her","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, March 22nd. Hang out at Kajuns and the Full Moon Hash! Meet at Kajuns (2256 St Claude Ave, New Orleans, LA 70117) at 6:00. You can either stay at Kajuns and enjoy some karaoke, or wander on down the road to the Full Moon Hash. Here's the info on the Full Moon Hash:\n\"NOLA Full Moon Hash! Trail# ? The Worm Moon! Friday, March 22nd, 2019\n7:00 pm show/ 7:30 go!\nHares: Whordini & Woody Poke Her\nBeer hare: Full Moon \"MM\"\nPrelube: Mags 940\nStart: 940 Elysian Fields Ave, New Orleans, LA 70117\nOn after: Kajuns (Karaoke!)\nTrail is dog friendly, but there will be some Shiggy so watch their feet for debris/trash hazards!\nApprox 3.5 miles, mild Shiggy $5 will get you a shitty trail, beer & snacks!\"","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10al6008m07kzoh4eeyaq","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1598 – Irish Italian Parade Hash","old_title_md5":"a453a713186bda49b83428d537f24e35","set_hares":true,"hares":"Pink n Fuzzy (trail), Shitty Titties (beer), & Boner Lisa (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1598. Sunday, March 24th. Irish Italian Parade Hash! Hare: Pink n Fuzzy (trail), Shitty Titties (beer), & Boner Lisa (food) Location: Meet at the Chase Bank on the corner of Vets and Homestead (1400 Veteranss Blvd., Metairie, LA 70005). Time: 11:00 show, 11:30 go. Cost: $10\nPlenty of beer and food and a parade!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10am8008o07kz1eyvfegr","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social @ Second Line Brewing","old_title_md5":"562d4d73eaa103160a1132b066a8226c","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, March 29th. Come on out for some crawfish and beer and bingo! Meet at Second Line Brewing (433 N Bernadotte St, New Orleans, LA 70119) at 5:00 for their crawfish. First drop will happen at 5:00 with more drops coming after that. There will also be a charity bingo event starting at 6:30 that will benefit Mr. Head's students. Come check it out and try to win yourself some prizes while you're pinching tails and sucking heads!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10an5008q07kzhr4iinnc","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1599","old_title_md5":"de8795a4099bffe4fa325d81289fe912","set_hares":true,"hares":"In the Kitchen (trail and food) & What's Warm (trail), and CUM (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1599. Monday, April 1st. 4th Anal MLB Opening Day Hash! Hares: In the Kitchen (trail and food) & What's Warm (trail), and CUM (beer). Location: Field 1 at Wally Pontiff Playground (1521 Palm St, Metairie, LA 70001). Time: 6:00 show, 6:30 go. $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10ao4008s07kzqpkewkvx","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – It's","old_title_md5":"af0ae5aef66622d28d1baa075009a77a","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Saturday, April 6th. It's time for the NOH3 crawfish boil!!! We'll meet at The Fly (6500 Magazine St, New Orleans, LA 70118) for some crawdads, beers, and fun. Kegs tapped at 11:00. First batch of crawfish go in the water at noon. Price:\n$15 for hashers who have attended at least 6 hashes in the past 12 months. $20 for hashers who have attended fewer than 6 hashes in the past 12 months.\n$5 for kids under 12 years old. Bring a folding chair if you'd like somewhere to sit!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10ap4008u07kzt2ujjdyz","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1600","old_title_md5":"c5d142db9c35d13411945cc3783f2d28","set_hares":true,"hares":"CUM muter ⚰ (trail) and C.U.M. (beer and food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1600. Monday, April 8th. Hare: CUM muter ⚰ (trail) and C.U.M. (beer and food). Location: On Bayou St. John at the corner of Moss and Harding. Time: 6:00 show, 6:30 go. $7\nTrail will be short so we can catch the sunset on da bayou. Walkers follow trail & 🐕 friendly.\nBring a chair or blanket for 🌅.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnezvwma000c07jtbgh6vy23","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – French Quarter Fest","old_title_md5":"fcd039aa6f3fcbd845d1e80d72cb38e7","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, April 12th. French Quarter Fest! Meet at NOLA Cantina (437 Esplanade Ave, New Orleans, LA 70116) at 4:00 then venture out into the fest.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10ar2008w07kz6y7uaih1","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1601 – Tax day hash","old_title_md5":"8413390ec6615a849e7bf43bc9081681","set_hares":true,"hares":"C.U.M. (trail & beer) & Saved by the Bush (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1601. Monday, April 15th. Tax day hash! Hare: C.U.M. (trail & beer) & Saved by the Bush (food). Location: Start will be across the street -Loyola- from the post office by the Superdome. The post office's address is: 701 Loyola Ave, New Orleans, LA 70113\nTime: 6:00 show, 6:30 go. Cost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnezvwn9000e07jt6j0zzeol","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social","old_title_md5":"85304001bf1e2928650732cfe672dff9","set_hares":true,"hares":"Woody Poke Her","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, April 19th. Meet at 6:00 for the NOH3/Cap’n Fun Runners Pre- CCC Social. This Fantastic event is once again at the Piazza d’ Italia. Meet on the Lafayette St. side just down the block from Ernst Cafe. Beer will be provided by NOH3 and Cap’nFun. There's also a Full Moon hash that night. Full Moon trail info:\nNOLA Full Moon Hash! The PINK 🌚!\nTrail# ummm?\nFriday, April 19\n7 pm show/ 7:30 pm go!!\nHare: Woody Poke Her\nBeer hare: FM “MM”\nStart: corner of Commerce & Lafayette Street\nPrelube: The NOH3 social with Capt. Fun 🏃 On after: Ernst Cafe, 600 S. Peters St.\nTrail is NOT dog friendly.\n$5 gets u a shitty trail, 🍺 & snacks!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10asp008y07kz4lxr25ya","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1602 – The 23rd Anal Lakeview Hash","old_title_md5":"2d3d7190685b8e0ea62fb485e21890c7","set_hares":true,"hares":"Bleeding Paloma and High Beams (trail and food) and Yank My Doodle (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1602. Monday, April 22nd. The 23rd Anal Lakeview Hash. Hares: Bleeding Paloma and High Beams (trail and food) and Yank My Doodle (beer). Meet at 171 Harrison Avenue. (Near West End). Look for Solar Panels and the Pussy on the Roof. 6:00PM Show, 6:30 Go., Cost $7.00.\nIt's also awards night!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnezvwoe000g07jthmvog8ej","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social @ Liuzza's by the Track","old_title_md5":"f40f4ac2c9905d6c63d8d014a91a2fd7","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, April 26th. It's Jazz Fest season --- you can't drink all day if you don't start in the morning! Meet at Liuzza's by the Track (1518 N Lopez St, New Orleans, LA 70119) from 9:00am-11:00am to get your morning cocktails before heading to the Fest.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10aui009007kz1kmhd0sq","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1603","old_title_md5":"4d60c6dd69967ab134fa0cf3679c3505","set_hares":true,"hares":"Whoredini (trail), C.U.M. (food), & Only Oral (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1603. Monday, April 29th. Hares: Whoredini (trail), C.U.M. (food), & Only Oral (beer). Start: Evans Playground (5112 Lasalle St, New Orleans, LA 70115)\nTime: 6:00 show, 6:30 go. Cost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnezvwpa000i07jt6vccfpp9","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – It's Jazz Fest season --- you know the drill","old_title_md5":"f2f84c771546c41211acdd89543b542f","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, May 3rd. It's Jazz Fest season --- you know the drill! You can't drink all day if you don't start in the morning. Meet at Liuzza's by the Track (1518 N Lopez St, New Orleans, LA 70119) from 9:00am-11:00am to get your morning cocktails before heading to the Fest.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10avt009207kzvdxczrg8","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1604 – Cinco de Mayo Hash","old_title_md5":"b22df6c8d71cca3571883ea789cee162","set_hares":true,"hares":"C.U.M (trail), Snatch Shot (food), & Yank My Doodle (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1604. Monday, May 6th. Cinco de Mayo Hash!!! Hares: C.U.M (trail), Snatch Shot (food), & Yank My Doodle (beer). Location: The neutral ground in front of El Gato Negro (300 Harrison Ave, New Orleans, LA 70124).Time: 6:00 show, 6:30 go. Cost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnezvwqe000k07jtk6n2cegt","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social","old_title_md5":"61c55d8dc776aa3dfff228682c0c8915","set_hares":true,"hares":"Shitty Titties","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, May 10th. Meet at 6:00 at NOLA Brewing (3001 Tchoupitoulas St, New Orleans, LA 70115). You can also go for a run with the Full Moon Hash that evening. Their trail info:\nNOLA Full Moon Hash!\nTrail # Omega 4B THE FLOWER MOON!\nFriday, May 10, 2019\n7:00 pm show/7:30 pm go!\nHare: Shitty Titties\nBeer hare: FM \"MM\" Pop Her Smurf Start: NOLA Brewery 3001 Tchoupitoulas Prelube: NOLA Brewery\nOn After: NOLA Brewery Trail is dog friendly.\n$5 gets you a shitty trail, beer & snacks!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10axa009407kzdswuhtke","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1605 – The annual Peter Teaser/Buttless Birthday Run","old_title_md5":"88eac3b7ded7d93ceea1ad9bc9c76948","set_hares":true,"hares":"Spotted Dick (trail), Boa Hoa (food), & Yank My Doodle (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1605. Monday, May 13th. The annual Peter Teaser/Buttless Birthday Run. Hares: Spotted Dick (trail), Boa Hoa (food), & Yank My Doodle (beer). Location: Meet at the Hash Fountain. It's a water fountain on the edge of City Park across from Ralph's on the Park (900 City Park Ave, New Orleans, LA 70119). Time: 6:00 show, 6:30 go. Cost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnezvwrp000m07jtt0b4ylzs","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – It's the Tchoupitoulas Bar-a-thon","old_title_md5":"785f9de827036d20145d2f46dbb2e3e2","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, May 17th. It's the Tchoupitoulas Bar-a-thon! If you're not already running or beer slinging at one of the stops, here's your chance to hang out. Meet at the start of the run at LE BON TEMPS ROULE (4801 Magazine) at 5:30. Then wander on over to the end of the run at GRIT'S BAR (530 Lyons). All of the runners and most of the beer slingers will likely end up at Grits at some point too.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10ays009607kzkfcoxzlg","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1606 – Tchoupitoulas Hashathon Take Deux","old_title_md5":"ab0e61a23abeb11ac8773d443493e1b9","set_hares":true,"hares":"IHOV & No Cuntroll (trail & food) & Yank My Doodle (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1606. Sunday, May 19th. Tchoupitoulas Hashathon Take Deux : 1/3 the Distance 3 times the Beer! Hares: IHOV & No Cuntroll (trail & food) & Yank My Doodle (beer). Location: Le Bon Temps (4801 Magazine St, New Orleans, LA 70115). Time: 3:00 show, 3:30 go. Cost: $7.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10azt009807kzx9usqk4p","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – Opa","old_title_md5":"e33df0a30090b065db2f0351586f0080","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, May 24th. Opa! Meet at Greek Fest at 6:00pm. Festival entry price is $8. For more info: http://www.greekfestnola.com","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10b0x009a07kz5rtn15ns","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1607 – Memorial Day Hash, Boil, & Pool Party","old_title_md5":"96fe53a0cf27f8d80bb639d778ad6684","set_hares":true,"hares":"Cooter Webs & Saved by the Bush (trail), Piston Penis (beer), & Came Upon Me (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1607. Monday, May 27th. Memorial Day Hash, Boil, & Pool Party! Hares: Cooter Webs & Saved by the Bush (trail), Piston Penis (beer), & Came Upon Me (food). Location: Wally Pontiff Playground (1521 Palm St, Metairie, LA 7000).Time: 12:30 show, 1:00 go. Cost: Cost: $15.\n** If you're doing trail, it is also advised that you bring $2 in cash with you. **\nNITTY GRITTY DETAILS: After trail, there's a crawfish boil and pool party at Piston Penis' house. The cost for trail covers the cost for the boil --- the cost is the same no matter if you just do trail, come late for the boil, or do the whole thing. It is what it is. No kids or pets at the house. This lovely shit show comes to an end at 8:00pm sharp. Please don't push that time limit; our hosts are being super nice in having the hash over, and they'd like us out by 8:00 at the latest. Let's have a great day!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10b1x009c07kzx9oy5rzb","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social","old_title_md5":"850461d086a7d020d84c3e95a72c8b6c","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, May 31st. Shitty Titties is heading out of town for a while, and it's time to send him off in style! Full Moon has put this event together: come hang out from 6:00-9:00 at Mick's Irish Pub (4801 Bienville Ave, New Orleans, LA 70119) and show Shitty Titties some love before he leaves!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10b43009g07kzo63j2k30","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1608 – The second anal (belated) KY Derby Hash","old_title_md5":"bb110025f123d8b546e42197583eb634","set_hares":true,"hares":"Pink n Fuzzy (trail), Shitty Titties (beer), & Skid Mark (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1608. Sunday, June 2nd. The second anal (belated) KY Derby Hash. Wear your best floral hat... or bridle and riding crop... your choice 😉 Hare: Pink n Fuzzy (trail), Shitty Titties (beer), & Skid Mark (food). Location: Homedale Inn (618 Homedale St, New Orleans, LA 70124). Time: 12:00 show, 12:30 go. Cost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10b54009i07kzdtb5d84d","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social @ Marie's Bar and Kitchen","old_title_md5":"29e00c6673d4d9fbf5ece20535764317","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, June 7th. Meet at Marie's Bar and Kitchen (2483 Burgundy St, New Orleans, LA 70117) at 6:00pm. Word has it that their menu is pretty darn good on Friday nights. https://www.mariesbarandkitchen.com","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10b63009k07kzg859vc3p","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social, Part Deux @ Brieux Carre","old_title_md5":"bc4f6305f9ae332020152b4d2020c548","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social, Part Deux... Saturday, June 8th. Meet at Brieux Carre (2115 Decatur St, New Orleans, LA 70116) at 4:00pm. The World Naked Bike Ride starts around 5:00pm And then the Pride Parade starts around 7:30.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10b78009m07kzli2r5hcr","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1609","old_title_md5":"9aa672ed4bdc271671ee07b485950c19","set_hares":true,"hares":"Saved by the Bush & Floggying Polly (trail), Lil Red Head (beer), & C.U.M. (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1609. Monday, June 10th. Hares: Saved by the Bush & Floggying Polly (trail), Lil Red Head (beer), & C.U.M. (food). Location: Audubon Park at the shelter near the clubhouse (6500 Magazine St, New Orleans, LA 70118). Time: 6:00 show, 6:30 go. $7.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10b8d009o07kzb59qj8o8","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social @ Parlay's","old_title_md5":"1d8e97be9b6b79d2eb702e91a07628e7","set_hares":true,"hares":"Saved By the Bush","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, June 14th. Meet at Parlay's ( 870 Harrison Ave, New Orleans, LA 70124) at 6:00. There's also a Full Moon trail that evening if you'd like to go for a run :) Here's their info:\nNOLA 🌕 HASH!!\nTrail # Omega 4C The 🍓 🌚!\nFriday, June 14, 2019\n7 pm show/ 7:30 pm go!\nHare: Saved By the Bush Beer hare: FM \"MM\"\nPrelube: Parlays on Harrison Start: The playground on Magnolia Drive just off Harrison Ave in City Park $5 gets you a shitty trail, beer & snacks!!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10b9l009q07kzej502v1w","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1610 – Here's the trail info from the","old_title_md5":"7187429262ec6a9941e7d657f8e50cb9","set_hares":true,"hares":"1800 Show - 1830 Go","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1610. Monday, June 17th. Here's the trail info from the hares:\n1800 Show - 1830 Go\nHash cash: $7\nPark at Prytania and Upperline\nTail/Food Hares - Mr. Mum and Old Hag\nBeer Hare - Lil Red Head\nCalling all Wankers. You can cum at the Choripan Hash. What´s that?...After an exhilarating run/walk through uptown the real fun starts. You put the tube between the buns and apply the scented lubricant. Then you jam it into your hole. After some time a sweet, sticky substance will appear for you to lick!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10bar009s07kzg0p0m0uc","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – And it's not getting postponed this","old_title_md5":"807468311ea3fe5d1f440d7c83d90758","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, June 21st. Crescent Shiggy is going to Mags, and gosh darnit we're going too! And it's not getting postponed this time! (probably)\nMeet at Mags 940 (940 Elysian Fields Ave, New Orleans, LA 70117) at 6:00. The drag show starts at 7:30, so buy your tickets in advance if you'd like to go. Folks who don't want to stay for the show will be splitting off and going to another nearby bar (TBD).","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10bc2009u07kz8xq2lv7c","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1611 – *Special Note","old_title_md5":"a95938f7e678c6f01e906783fa3aafe6","set_hares":true,"hares":"Whordini (trail) Possible Celebrity Guest Hare TBD, C.U.M. (food), & Yank My Doodle (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1611. Monday, June 24th\n*Special Note: The Hare is encouraging donations to the LSPCA for this trail and will be collecting if anyone wants to donate!*\nHare: Whordini (trail) Possible Celebrity Guest Hare TBD, C.U.M. (food), & Yank My Doodle (beer).\nStart/PreLube: Seahorse Saloon (1648 Gentilly Blvd, New Orleans, LA 70119)\nOnAfter: Jockeys Pub (1841 Gentilly Blvd, New Orleans, LA 70119)\nTime: 6:00 show, 6:30 go. Cost: $7\nBring: Whistle, flashlight, vessel, $$ to donate to the LSPCA*","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10bdp009w07kz4lasnrv8","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – It's taco Friday","old_title_md5":"d83d7678069ce7853efabc934fd37093","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, June 28th. It's taco Friday! Meet at NOLA Cantina (437 Esplanade Ave, New Orleans, LA 70116) at 6:00.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10ben009y07kzv4zhke1w","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1612 – It's Independence Day Week","old_title_md5":"22049848c78a115c336e25aa8c9fe25c","set_hares":true,"hares":"Petrified Wood (trail), C.U.M. (food), & Yank My Doodle (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1612. Monday, July 1st. It's Independence Day Week! The hare has said that patriotic attire is approptiate this week 😁 Hare: Petrified Wood (trail), C.U.M. (food), & Yank My Doodle (beer). Location: Robért Fresh Market on Robert E. Lee (135 Robert E Lee Blvd, New Orleans, LA 70124. Time: 6:00 show, 6:30 go. Cost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10bfo00a007kzbn5gfzbu","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – It's almost Independence Day","old_title_md5":"a81125ce1d2406320c6add3a6deedc97","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Wednesday, July 3rd. It's almost Independence Day! Meet at City Park's \"Happy 3rd of July\" at 5:30. The event itself is from 7:00-9:45, but it gets pretty crowded. NOH3 will have a spot staked out on the lawn, and City Park will have bands and fireworks! You can bring your own food, and they'll have some food for sale at the park as well. Here's the link for more info: http://neworleanscitypark.com/events/3rd-of-july","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10bgo00a207kzeymj31a3","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social @ Rivershack Gretna","old_title_md5":"2e8c3658f2d3d6c64105a268a417227b","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Drinking practice and Independence Day celebrations! Meet at Rivershack Gretna (714 1st St, Gretna, LA 70053) at 6:00. Drinks and food for sale at the bar, then wander up the levee to watch fireworks over the river. Fireworks start at 9:00. Website for more info:\nhttps://www.neworleans.com/event/go-fourth-on-the-river/4051/","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10bhl00a407kzjr601zlh","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1613 – The Running of the Bullshit","old_title_md5":"278bafc048f6e8c5bf7a1570eb36e11d","set_hares":true,"hares":"CUM muter ⚰ & friends (trail), C.U.M. (food), & Yank my Doodle (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1613. Monday, July 8th. The Running of the Bullshit! Hare: CUM muter ⚰ & friends (trail), C.U.M. (food), & Yank my Doodle (beer). Location: Kennedy Place Park. Time: 6:00 show, 6:30 go. Cost: $10.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10bit00a607kzrztqmmwi","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social","old_title_md5":"eced733416fe6eb20c0a508487984eef","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, July 12th. Meet up with the Guam social bar crawl at Urban South Brewery (1645 Tchoupitoulas St, New Orleans, LA 70130) at 4:00.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10bjs00a807kzn8h131c8","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1614 – It's the","old_title_md5":"6c27f5850221ed2d295deccee0de6343","set_hares":true,"hares":"In the Kitchen and Moist of All (trail), We'd Eat Her (beer), & Upper Dicker (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1614. Monday, July 15th. It's the hares' birthday trail! Hares: In the Kitchen and Moist of All (trail), We'd Eat Her (beer), & Upper Dicker (food). Location: Homedale Inn (618 Homedale St, New Orleans, LA 70124). Time: 6:00 show, 6:30 go. Cost: $7.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10bkp00aa07kz66wbblno","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social @ Genarro's Bar","old_title_md5":"3618d5e3ac95b1ce21ddbf8867e70d94","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, July 19th. Meet at Genarro's Bar (3206 Metairie Rd, Metairie, LA 70001) at 6:00. There will be a Full Moon trail starting within walking distance at 7:00.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10blo00ac07kzv4swy4ea","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1615","old_title_md5":"1ecb870c5ac69720ecd2eb98da4ff68c","set_hares":true,"hares":"Cooter Webs & Bent Ova-board (trail), Cowboy (beer), & IHOV (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1615. Hare: Cooter Webs & Bent Ova-board (trail), Cowboy (beer), & IHOV (food). Location: Shelter 1 on Lakeshore Drive (the one nearest the lighthouse). Time: 6:00 show, 6:30 go. $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10bml00ae07kzvq3hl9k9","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – Drinking in Gentilly","old_title_md5":"6b346bb0ceb5054c569059281e4bda7f","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, July 26th. Drinking in Gentilly! Meet at Jockey's Pub (1841 Gentilly Blvd, New Orleans, LA 70119) at 6:00.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10bnp00ag07kzwnbtbamq","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1616","old_title_md5":"d46ebc8d91d39f0a4926e0fb285147d2","set_hares":true,"hares":"CUM Muter ⚰ and Dead Cell (trail), Yank my Doodle (beer), & C.U.M. (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1616. Monday, July 29th. Hares: CUM Muter ⚰ and Dead Cell (trail), Yank my Doodle (beer), & C.U.M. (food). Location: Prelube & On After: Miel Brewery (405 6th Street NOLA).\nStart: 6th & Livadaid Street. Time: 6:00 show, 6:30 go. Cost: $7. Awards happening at circle!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10bom00ai07kzxnx7bml4","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – Drinking in Metairie","old_title_md5":"3d78e9f9a57e47eb83d88ddc1d8ad6ab","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, August 2nd. Drinking in Metairie! Meet at Step Brothers Bar and Grill (4971 W Napoleon Ave, Metairie, LA 70001) at 6:00.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10bpo00ak07kzlgjcus5q","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – It's White Linen Night","old_title_md5":"c9a3ff95a10692cf30c95b1facd2a140","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Saturday, August 3rd. It's White Linen Night! Meet at White Linen Night at 5:30. Website with more info: https://www.neworleans.com/event/hancock-whitney-white-linen-night/3304/","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10bql00am07kztlfhyplz","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1617 – It's the NOH3 Red Skirt Run","old_title_md5":"f3bf767d91a05833ada75853a1836cec","set_hares":true,"hares":"It's the tri-fuckta: C.U.M., Yank My Doodle, & Lil Red Head. (there will be trail, food, and beer --- don't worry about who's doing what)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1617. Monday, August 5th. It's the NOH3 Red Skirt Run!!! Hare: It's the tri-fuckta: C.U.M., Yank My Doodle, & Lil Red Head. (there will be trail, food, and beer --- don't worry about who's doing what). Location: At the Mint on the Barracks/French Market side (400 Esplanade Ave, New Orleans, LA 70116). Time: 6:00 show, 6:30 go. Cost: $7.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10bvf00aw07kzoq090rdv","set_title":true,"title":"Too Late – RDR was Saturday","old_title_md5":"897d9492139e1fa459fc87e3d81c1185","set_desc":true,"description":"Too Late. RDR was Saturday.\nThere's a pick up trail though! Hare is starting as Bucakey, then who knows? Start at the hash fountain (in City Park, next to the entrance across from Ralph's on the Park). 6:00 show, 6:30 go. $0.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10bwg00ay07kz0yoxlkgk","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social @ Deutsches Haus","old_title_md5":"29ef2b880b9ad63b30c749fa64d47d41","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, August 16th. RDR is over, but that's no reason to stop having fun! Meet at Deutsches Haus (1700 Moss St, New Orleans, LA 70119) at 6:00.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10bxd00b007kzf98pds1p","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1619","old_title_md5":"3272c430091c5f7161d32f1aaa71d08a","set_hares":true,"hares":"Lil Red Head (trail), Lil Red Head (beer), & Saved by the Bush (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1619. Monday, August 19th. Hare: Lil Red Head (trail), Lil Red Head (beer), & Saved by the Bush (food). Location: Rivershack Tavern (3449 River Rd, New Orleans, LA 70121). Time: 6:00 show, 6:30 go. Cost: $7.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10by800b207kzf9kumlsb","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social @ Flamingo A-go-go","old_title_md5":"e0117a4897f3a734ebaa33b0b3288c67","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, August 23rd. Come hang out and grab some food and adult beverages at one of our Red Dress Run donor locations! Meet at Flamingo A-go-go (869 Magazine St, New Orleans, LA 70130) at 6:00. Happy hour specials from 4:00-7:00. https://flamingonola.com/menus/happy-hour","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10bz600b407kza1lp9ue0","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1620 – Halfway to Mardi Gras","old_title_md5":"57927c5954603856f6dd63f22735d025","set_hares":true,"hares":"Upper Dicker & Sux a Lot (trail), Yank My Doodle (beer), & Pulls Out Early (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1620. Monday, August 26th. Halfway to Mardi Gras! Hares: Upper Dicker & Sux a Lot (trail), Yank My Doodle (beer), & Pulls Out Early (food). Location: Marconi at Victory Ave., across from Delgado. Time: 6:00 show, 6:30 go. Cost: $7.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10c0600b607kzn9le67rc","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – It's the Metairie Beerathon","old_title_md5":"b6f086d40a124a5e58f8f92fc264d211","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, August 30th. It's the Metairie Beerathon! Meet at Gennaro's (3206 Metairie Rd, Metairie, LA 70001) at 6:00. Beer and food for sale at the bar. https://www.bearspoboys.com/\nThe run starts promptly at 6:30 outside of Gennaro's under the bridge, so get there a little early if you're wanting to do the run.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10c1300b807kzfwudu16l","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1621 – It's the Labor Day Hash","old_title_md5":"021a21307c63494b83859458114444c6","set_hares":true,"hares":"Piston Penis, Penis Colada, & Boner Lisa","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1621. Monday, September 2nd. It's the Labor Day Hash! Hares: Piston Penis, Penis Colada, & Boner Lisa. Location: The back shelter at Wally Pontiff Playground (.1521 Palm St, Metairie, LA 70001). Time: 2:00 show, 2:30 go. Cost: $10.\nBBQ & pool at Piston Penis' house after. Bring a swimsuit and towel if you'd like to swim. The pool party ends promptly at 9:00pm --- please make sure that you have moved on by that time.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10c1y00ba07kz67bsh3ly","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – Plan to get there at 6","old_title_md5":"9ce064a988388ae6bef45a3367879864","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, September 6th. Join up with Crescent Shiggy and support their social! Crescent Shiggy will be having a Clue themed social at The Library New Orleans (3629 Prytania St, New Orleans, LA 70115) starting at 7:00. Plan to get there at 6:00 if you would like to start your drinking sooner 😁🍻🎩📿🔧🗡🕯😵","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10c2x00bc07kz0zgugupi","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1622 – Octoberfest","old_title_md5":"096f91a1a4c265c80ba9bae48a1655e4","set_hares":true,"hares":"The Big Lezbowski & Woody Poke Her (trail), Little Red Head (beer), & Came Upon Me (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1622. Sunday, September 8th. Octoberfest! Hare: The Big Lezbowski & Woody Poke Her (trail), Little Red Head (beer), & Came Upon Me (food). Location: Rouses on Tchoupitoulas (4500 Tchoupitoulas St, New Orleans, LA 70115). Time: 4:00 show, 4:30 go. Cost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10c3x00be07kzjodk8dac","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – NOH3 is providing a free keg","old_title_md5":"c695c2354ad731ce8f2006dab59f50a0","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, September 13th. Cum celebrate Kneez to Pleez at her retirement party! She's finally worked enough to quit working, so she's getting drunk! NOH3 is providing a free keg 🍻🍻 Meet at Mick's (4801 Bienville Ave, New Orleans, LA 70119) at 6:00. They'll have some pretty darn good food for sale as well.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10c4x00bg07kz87gfyrcf","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1623 – Halfway to St. Patrick's Day","old_title_md5":"a151d588dac4dc1a6d8e1d9dc23fe9c1","set_hares":true,"hares":"Pop-Her Smurf (trail), C.U.M. (beer), & C.U.M. (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1623. Monday, September 16th. Halfway to St. Patrick's Day! Wear your kilt! Hare: Pop-Her Smurf (trail), C.U.M. (beer), & C.U.M. (food). Location: Intersection of Jeff Davis and Canal. Prelube at Holy Ground. Time: 6:00 show, 6:30 go. Cost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10c6700bi07kzc944a12m","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – Full Moon H3 is having a trail tonight","old_title_md5":"5a96dd8955ed895aef0cc10672d926ae","set_hares":true,"hares":"Pop Her Smurf Brian BE","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, September 20th. Full Moon H3 is having a trail tonight! Meet at Parlay's (870 Harrison Ave, New Orleans, LA 70124) at 6:00 to grab a beer before trail or to just stay at the bar until the pack gets back 😁\nTheir trail info:\nNOLA FULL MOON HASH!!!\nTrail # Omega 4F The Harvest Moon!!!\nFriday, September 20, 2019\n7:00 PM SHOW/7:30 PM GO!!!\nHare: Pop Her Smurf Brian BE\nBeer hare: FM \"MM\"\nPrelube: Parlay’s,\n870 Harrison Ave, NOLA Start: Harrison Ave & Magnolia Dr.\n$5 hash cash gets you a shitty trail, beer & snacks!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10c7400bk07kz9aomzlpt","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social Part Deux","old_title_md5":"7795f227a5fef859d5149d083543b777","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social Part Deux! Saturday, September 21st. Meet up at NOLA On Tap. Folks will be wandering around, drinking beer, and looking at cute dogs all day. More info on NOLA On Tap: https://nolaontap.org/","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10c8900bm07kzbziu478l","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1624","old_title_md5":"1a7e4c28bce2528c3bf95c885d4e4d54","set_hares":true,"hares":"Bucakey & Saved by the Bush (trail), Yank My Doodle (beer), & Kneez to Pleez (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1624. Monday, September 23rd. Hare: Bucakey & Saved by the Bush (trail), Yank My Doodle (beer), & Kneez to Pleez (food). Location: intersection of Cartier and Riveria (by Arthur Ashe Charter School). Time: 6:00 show, 6:30 go. Cost: $7\nAwards happening at circle!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10c9c00bo07kzuew5mb8u","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – It's Gretna Fest","old_title_md5":"432198e0e12578c664474dcdc0d2bdbf","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, September 27th. It's Gretna Fest! Meet in the German beer garden at Gretna Fest at 6:00. Info on the fest: https://www.gretnafest.com/beer-garden.php","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10cam00bq07kz9ke9c6z0","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1625","old_title_md5":"260e9dfb2521b870e8d06e9ca384520c","set_hares":true,"hares":"Tits Don’t Fit & Whordini (trail), Upper Dicker (food), & Came Upon Me (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1625. Monday, September 30th.\nHares: Tits Don’t Fit & Whordini (trail), Upper Dicker (food), & Came Upon Me (beer). Location: 1202 Constance street (corner of Constance & Erato)\nTime: 6:00 show, 6:30 go. Cost: $7\nPre-Lube: Courtyard Brewery\nOn-After: Rusty Nail","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10cbj00bs07kz2dxbi431","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – It's Oktober Fest","old_title_md5":"b7f8646e8cbda42914a7ea599499a2f3","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, October 4th. It's Oktober Fest! Meet at Deutsches Haus (1700 Moss St, New Orleans, LA 70119) at 6:00. More info on the fest: https://oktoberfestnola.com/","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10ccj00bu07kz7a2sdk9n","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1626","old_title_md5":"4299cbc82992df8801c9f6875b1b1929","set_hares":true,"hares":"Hitachi Topic & CUMuter (trail), Only Oral (beer), & Upper Dicker (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1626. Monday, October 7th. Hare: Hitachi Topic & CUMuter (trail), Only Oral (beer), & Upper Dicker (food). Location: Lyons Playground (624 Louisiana Ave. New Orleans, LA 70115) Time: 6:00 show, 6:30 go. Cost: $7.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10cdk00bw07kzgxrwjwvb","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – Full Moon has a trail nearby that evening","old_title_md5":"e9bc80dcbfccf46e1d52d349f47c3600","set_hares":true,"hares":"CUM muter & Dead Cell","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, October 11th. We'll be meeting at the Rivershack Tavern (3449 River Rd, New Orleans, LA 70121) at 6:00. Full Moon has a trail nearby that evening. Here's the info on that trail:\nNOLA FULL MOON HASH!!!!\nTrail # Omega 4G The Hunter's Moon!\nFriday, October 11, 2019\n7 PM SHOW/7:30 GO!\nHares: CUM muter & Dead Cell\nBeer Hare: FM \"MM\"\nPrelube: Rivershack on River Rd.\nStart: St. George Ave & River Rd.\nOn After: New Orleans Nightmare Experience Haunted House! (319 Butterworth St.) Wear your Halloween costumes!!!! $5 hash cash gets you a shitty trail, beer & snacks!!!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10cei00by07kzyr3einbj","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1627","old_title_md5":"104de1d770fc1705f9797554cf5e9104","set_hares":true,"hares":"Little Red Head (trail & beer) & We'd Eat Her (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1627. Monday, October 14th. Hare: Little Red Head (trail & beer) & We'd Eat Her (food). Location: The parking lot by the ferry in Algiers. Time: 6:00 show, 6:30 go. Cost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10cfe00c007kzcqbjq518","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – Good on 'em","old_title_md5":"c5d48b971bef888238ae8ef455e2ec79","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, October 18th. Cum support one of the few bars in the area that hosted an event on RDR day and made a donation to RDR from that event. Good on 'em! Meet at Good Friends (740 Dauphine St, New Orleans, LA 70116) at 6:00.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10cgh00c207kz5ex6oq17","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1628","old_title_md5":"946f58d900a46915c53854298e42de1f","set_hares":true,"hares":"Cooter Webs, Saved by the Bush, & CUM Muter (trail), Shitty Titties (beer), & Snatch Shot & Squirts on Santa (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1628. Monday, October 21st. The 5th anal Happy Hooters Hash Pink Dress Run! Hares: Cooter Webs, Saved by the Bush, & CUM Muter (trail), Shitty Titties (beer), & Snatch Shot & Squirts on Santa (food). Location: Parlay's (870 Harrison Ave, New Orleans, LA 70124). Time: 6:00 show, 6:30 go. Cost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10chq00c407kz9m93oric","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – Boobs","old_title_md5":"03ddcf709ece189879b73cd679c4e73c","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, October 25th. Boobs!! It's October, so we're going to celebrate the boobies by going to Hooters! Meet at Hooters (4748 Veterans Blvd, Metairie, LA 70006) at 6:00. Their happy hour ends at 6:00 though, so all you over-achievers could get their earlier and get yourself a cheaper beer!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10ciz00c607kzk3h40o97","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1629 – The Halloweenie Hash","old_title_md5":"efbdfb52777b441abfea61d27c4c2262","set_hares":true,"hares":"CUMmuter, Dead Cell, & Saved by the Bush (trail), Sucks Em Raw (food), & Shitty Titties (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1629. Monday, October 28th. The Halloweenie Hash!!\nWear your Halloween best!Hare: CUMmuter, Dead Cell, & Saved by the Bush (trail), Sucks Em Raw (food), & Shitty Titties (beer). Location: corner of N. Anthony and Conti. Time: 6:00 show, 6:30 go. Cost: $7. of N. Anthony & Conti\nTrue Trail will be 3.2 miles & will have 🦃/Eagle splits!\nThere will be tricks, treats and a game to solve! Awards at circle!\nOn after: Mick's.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10ckc00c807kzs4xu5i4r","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – The details on the run","old_title_md5":"5cf94dd067b5c8243e8b1b09af2ccb0f","set_hares":true,"hares":"In the Kitchen & The Iceman Thumbeth","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, November 1st. We're joining Voodoo H3 at the prelube for their Black Dress Run at 6:00: Evangeline Lounge (4501 Toulouse St, New Orleans, LA 70119).\nThe details on the run: Black Dress, a Voodoo H3 tradition, is the same day as All Saints’ Day. Tradition for the holiday, which is also called Hallow’s Day, is one of three days meant to celebrate the deceased. Come on out, don your finest black attire, and follow trail to pay your respects (flowers and candles are customary) with Voodoo H3 on a quiet and dark Friday in Mid-City. Bring: $1 (no coins); 6-pack (glass discouraged), whistle, flashlight. 6:30pm show, 7:00pm GO! Theme: Black Dress Start Address: Evangeline Lounge (4501 Toulouse St) Hare & Co-hares: In the Kitchen & The Iceman Thumbeth, Beer hare: Tidy Bowl Man Pre-Lube: Evangeline Lounge (4501 Toulouse St) On-After: Evangeline Lounge (4501 Toulouse St) Not Dog Friendly.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10cld00ca07kzfk4z6hd8","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1630","old_title_md5":"55f4fb8d8627a32f66b5c7c7cb31504b","set_hares":true,"hares":"Yank My Doodle (trail), Piston Penis (beer), & Boner Lisa & C.U.M. (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1630. Sunday, November 3rd. It's the Saints bye week, so come hang out and enjoy a Sunday off! Hares: Yank My Doodle (trail), Piston Penis (beer), & Boner Lisa & C.U.M. (food). Location: the back lot in Wally Pontiff Playground (1521 Palm St, Metairie, LA 70001). Time: 2:00 show, 2:30 go. Cost: $7.\nPool/hot tub party at Piston Penis' house after, so bring your swimwear. No pets at on-after. On-after ends at 9:00 sharp.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10cmh00cc07kza1tb53am","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – Homedale Inn","old_title_md5":"e06a79fffa2aa7fa3ba541be21d3cbf7","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, November 8th. By popular demand, this week's social will be at: Homedale Inn! (618 Homedale St, New Orleans, LA 70124). Congrats to Homedale for winning this poll. Social starts at 6:00 😁🍺","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10cnk00ce07kzndd6ub45","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1631 – Veterans Day Hash","old_title_md5":"004c466c494e210cf575a0e6995e23e5","set_hares":true,"hares":"Bucakey & Shitty Titties (trail), Shitty Titties (beer), & C.U.M. (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1631. Monday, November 11th. Veterans Day Hash! Hares: Bucakey & Shitty Titties (trail), Shitty Titties (beer), & C.U.M. (food). Location: Vietnam War Memorial.\nPoydras Street & Clara Street\nOn the Poydras St. side of the Super Dome. Time: 6:00 show, 6:30 go. Cost: $7.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10con00cg07kzrn1r4x0r","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social @ Jockey's","old_title_md5":"048512590a3dcb70f8a6ae54d24c9914","set_hares":true,"hares":"Came Upon Me & Chocolate Lady","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, November 15th. There's a Full Moon trail tonight, and we'll be hanging out with them! Meet at Jockey's (1841 Gentilly Blvd. NOLA) at 6:00, trail starts at 7:00. Here's the trail info. NOLA FULL MOON HASH!!!\nTrail# Omega 4H The Beaver Moon!!\nFriday, November 15, 2019\n7 PM SHOW/7:30 PM GO!!\nHares: Came Upon Me & Chocolate Lady\nBeer Hare: FM \"MM\"\nPrelube: Jockey's 1841 Gentilly Blvd. NOLA Start: Corner of Gentilly Blvd & Castiglione On After: TBA\n$5 hash cash gets you beer, snacks & a shitty trail!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10cpo00ci07kzdud6bu2i","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1632","old_title_md5":"46d2fabe910834993148e340d38892ec","set_hares":true,"hares":"CUM muter ⚰️ & Just Caitlin (trail), Little Red Head (beer), & Hitachi Topic (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1632. Monday, November 18th. Hare: CUM muter ⚰️ & Just Caitlin (trail), Little Red Head (beer), & Hitachi Topic (food). Prelube: River Shack Gretna - Yes, it's on the Westbank ya heard me, so pack a 🥪!\nStart: Corner of 1st & Huey P. Long Ave. Time: 6:00 show, 6:30 go. Cost: $7.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10cqk00ck07kzwtzfsgl5","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – event","old_title_md5":"81da9916593d15fe268667ce58e6aa72","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, November 22nd. Come to Port Orleans (4124 Tchoupitoulas St, New Orleans, LA 70115) for their Friyay! event. $4 pints, pretzels, and fried pickles from 4:00-8:00. Meet there at 6:00 --- or earlier if you're an overachiever.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10crh00cm07kzeusszn7p","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1633 – Hashgiving","old_title_md5":"3cb1691d43c1cd6697daff6738ad8bdc","set_hares":true,"hares":"Mismanagement","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1633. Saturday, November 23rd. Hashgiving! Hare: Mismanagement. Pink n Fuzzy & Lil Red Head (trail), Yank my Doodle (beer), everyone (food). Location: Trail start is at Rummel (1901 Severn Ave, Metairie, LA 70001) at the parking lot on Severn at 39th St. by the track. On-after is at Slick's house (address to be posted later). Time: 11:69 show, 12:30 go. Kitchen opens at 11:00 to drop off food. Cost: $5 with a dish or $15 without a dish. Erections taking place at trail! Bring a chair if you'd like a spot to sit. Not a pet friendly event.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10csi00co07kzteqtql8n","set_title":true,"title":"Pick up hash","old_title_md5":"d14164e05cedf175a2633a0c4f94c44a","set_hares":true,"hares":"C.U.M","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"Pick up hash. Monday, November 25th. Hare: C.U.M.\nLocation: Start at the hash fountain. It's right outside of the entrance to City Park across from Ralph's on the Park. Time: 6:00 show, 6:30 go.\nCanned beer. No food. Hash cash: $0","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10ctk00cq07kzsv2v2yce","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social","old_title_md5":"c7cd1976f9b76aec326bb2b1caa4719d","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, November 29th. Once you've wrapped up your Black Friday shopping, come grab a beer at Brewsky's (2205 David Dr, Metairie, LA 70003) --- formerly Tarpon Joes. Meet there at 5:00.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10cum00cs07kzqqkz5a35","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1634","old_title_md5":"c34e711126c64c5b66f19071bc23c7c1","set_hares":true,"hares":"Whordini & tba (trail), Shitty Titties (beer), & C.U.M. (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1634\nMonday, December 2nd\nHares: Whordini & tba (trail), Shitty Titties (beer), & C.U.M. (food)\nLocation: The Hash Fountain corner of City Park Avenue & Anseman Ave (across from Ralph’s at city park)\nTime: 6:00 show, 6:30 go. Cost: $7\nTrail will be dog friendly & around 3ish miles so people can attend Merry Mutt Monday’s at Celebration at the Oaks for on after if they’d like https://www.facebook.com/events/3338415569532016/?ti=ia","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10cvr00cu07kzfaie0bb7","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Christmas Party – Come kick your Christmas season off right","old_title_md5":"872557edcd2f2305933c8e4e28cc98d0","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Christmas Party. Friday, December 6th. Come kick your Christmas season off right! $25 entry: open bar, lots of food, DJ, and a photo booth. Optional $20 white elephant gift exchange (wrap it on a bag only, no wrapping paper or tissue paper). Location: New Orleans Yacht Club (403 N Roadway St., New Orleans, LA 70124). Time: 7:00-11:00.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10cwy00cw07kzjtvou9z7","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1635","old_title_md5":"cdb2f12ab3046809de57731cd567f254","set_hares":true,"hares":"Saved by the Bush (trail), Upper Dicker (food) & Yank my Doodle (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1635. Monday, December 9th. Hare: Saved by the Bush (trail), Upper Dicker (food) & Yank my Doodle (beer). Location: The Capitol One Bank on Canal by Robert E. Lee (7033 Canal Blvd., New Orleans, LA 70124). Time: 6:00 show, 6:30 go. Cost: $7.\nBring a flashlight --- it gets dark early these days.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10cy400cy07kzwiqlqa0h","set_title":true,"title":"Social – Luna Fête","old_title_md5":"4b1e2d541c9f9c5666809a895443d20a","set_desc":true,"description":"Friday, December 13th. Social... Luna Fête! Meet at Lafayette Square in front of Gallier Hall (545 St Charles Ave, New Orleans, LA 70130) 6:00. If you wrap up at Luna Fête and want more shenanigans, the Full Moon hash will be having their on-after at Monkey Board (1111 Gravier St).","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10cz100d007kzhtj4oxn0","set_title":true,"title":"Bonus social","old_title_md5":"52690431aa1f538011e5499c205c5deb","set_desc":true,"description":"Bonus social! Saturday, December 14th. The Very Bad Santa Crawl will be taking place this evening -- great stops, great drink specials, and great people. Starts at 5pm at NOLA Cantina ( 437 Esplanade Ave, New Orleans, LA 70116). Buy tickets online in advance at half-price (http://www.busting-loose.net/santacrawl/) or pay full price at the door.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10d0300d207kzn1cpcwc9","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1636","old_title_md5":"e6f9b7b2b91b9971e4bc44651cc502a3","set_hares":true,"hares":"Little Red Head (trail), We'd Eat Her (food), & Yank My Doodle (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1636. Sunday, December 15th. Hares: Little Red Head (trail), We'd Eat Her (food), & Yank My Doodle (beer). Location: the park on three corner of Rousseau street and soraparu. Time: 2:00 show, 2:30 go. Cost: $7\nOn after at Tchoup Yard if you'd like to watch some football.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10d1000d407kz6whrppcd","set_title":true,"title":"Social @ Brewsky's","old_title_md5":"d04ddbed24519d6796a4b2de0311586c","set_desc":true,"description":"Friday, December 20th. Social... Meet at Brewsky's (2205 David Dr, Metairie, LA 70003) at 6:00 -- get there early for happy hour pricing. After grabbing a beer, wander through Lafreniere Park to see the Christmas lights.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10d2200d607kz3bti8839","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1637 – Wear ur Xmas attire or Saints","old_title_md5":"52a5715d93d3db31ff23f4eaa8c53f48","set_hares":true,"hares":"CUM muter ⚰ & Dead Cell 💀 (trail) & Yank My Doodle (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1637. Sunday, December 22nd. 5th anal X-mas Hash! Wear ur Xmas attire or Saints ⚜️ gear!! Trail will be short and sweet!\n** Bring a vessel! **\nHares: CUM muter ⚰ & Dead Cell 💀 (trail) & Yank My Doodle (beer).\nLocation: Parking lot behind Walgreens at 101 Robert E. Lee Blvd.\nTime: 9:00 show, 9:30 go (sharp!).\nCost: $6 hash!!! There will be no food BUT there will be Mimosas, Irish Coffee, and Bloody Mary's!!!!\nOn after: Felix's, 7400 Lakeshore Drive. We have tables downstairs by the bar reserved for the game!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10d3100d807kz0ho6ycgn","set_title":true,"title":"Social – Umteenth Anal Winter Tour de Liqueur","old_title_md5":"ee6fcc271c6b4bd24dd0d99dab7bf4da","set_desc":true,"description":"Friday, December 27th. Social... Umteenth Anal Winter Tour de Liqueur. Meet at Parlay's (870 Harrison Ave., New Orleans, LA 70124) at 9:00 AM if you want to ride your bike on the tour and drink and eat your way accross the city. No entry fee - pay as you go. Ride at your own risk and bring what you need for the day. Or if you can't play during the day, meet the Tour back at Parlay's at 5:00 PM ish.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10d3x00da07kz6sbpk96k","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1638","old_title_md5":"302b730864005681a34b7eef57ba9019","set_hares":true,"hares":"Strip Club Abortion, Ketamine Kock, Bucakey, & Saved by the Bush (trail), Yank My Doodle (beer), & Bent Ova-board (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1638. Monday, December 30th. Hares: Strip Club Abortion, Ketamine Kock, Bucakey, & Saved by the Bush (trail), Yank My Doodle (beer), & Bent Ova-board (food). Location: parking lot at the Rusty Rainbow Bridge. If you need an address, put in the address for Pizza Delicious (617 Piety St, New Orleans, LA 70117) and go to the parking lot for the bridge into Crescent Park. Time: 6:00 show, 6:30 go. Cost: $7.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10d4w00dc07kzv10pcfke","set_title":true,"title":"Social","old_title_md5":"5f0b56c6d52b70a73fab45e786e78025","set_desc":true,"description":"Friday, January 3rd. Social... We're welcoming the new year with a Roaring 20's social! What better way to celebrate being back in the 20's than with booze? NOH3 will be providing a free keg. So don your best flapper outfit, be thankful that prohibition isn't making a comeback, and come celebrate!\nLocation: Mick's (4801 Bienville Ave, New Orleans, LA 70119)\nTime: 6pm","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10d5x00de07kznb7qkm4d","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1639 – King's Day Hash","old_title_md5":"aeb451b49f14decd82258ad17a2d58b9","set_hares":true,"hares":"Snatch Shot (trail), Squirts On Santa (food), & Shitty Titties (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1639. King's Day Hash!\nDate: Monday, January 6th\nHares: Snatch Shot (trail), Squirts On Santa (food), & Shitty Titties (beer)\nLocation: corner of Burgundy and St. Roch, in front of Marie's bar\nTime: 6:00 show, 6:30 go\nCost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnezvwsp000o07jtrpss1psv","set_title":true,"title":"Social @ Parkview Tavern","old_title_md5":"13b4955bd2456ea7fefbb385731ebfb8","set_hares":true,"hares":"Saved By the Bush","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"Friday, January 10th. Social... Meet at Parkview Tavern (910 N Carrollton Ave, New Orleans, LA 70119) at 6:00. There's also a Full Moon trail nearby that evening. Here's the info for their trail:\nNOLA FULL MOON HASH!!\nTrail # Omega 4J The Wolf Moon!!!!\nFriday, January 10, 2020\n7:00 PM SHOW/7:30 PM GO!!\nHare: Saved By the Bush\nBeer hare: FM \"MM\"\nStart: Magnolia Bridge (Cabrini Bridge/Blue Bridge) @ corner of Harding & Moss Prelube: Parkview Tavern (910 N Carrollton Ave, New Orleans, LA 70119) On after: TBD\n$5 gets you a shitty trail, beer & snacks! ON ON!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10d7700dg07kz5p2qr9a4","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1640","old_title_md5":"c16ed15697acce352c7bf7d7770df0be","set_hares":true,"hares":"Bent Ova-board & Little Red Head (trail), Yank My Doodle (beer), & Butt or Balls & We'd Eat Her (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1640. Date: Sunday, January 12th\nHares: Bent Ova-board & Little Red Head (trail), Yank My Doodle (beer), & Butt or Balls & We'd Eat Her (food)\nLocation: Flamingo A-go-go (869 Magazine St, New Orleans, LA 70130)\nTime: 12:00 show, 12:30 go\nCost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10d8100di07kzii8jrg18","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – Free keg social","old_title_md5":"db172106884493c90958e8c73e3b01f0","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, January 17th. Free keg social! Now that they're open again, we'll meet at Brothers III (4520 Magazine St, New Orleans, LA 70115) at 6:00.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10d8x00dk07kzzmcb0ev1","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1641 – Mimosa Hash in da parish","old_title_md5":"7adaa1fd8511c04e030f23080d037443","set_hares":true,"hares":"Down to the Last Drop & Wrong Hole (trail & food) & Yank my Doodle (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1641. Mimosa Hash in da parish!\nDate: Saturday, January 18th\nHares: Down to the Last Drop & Wrong Hole (trail & food) & Yank my Doodle (beer).\nLocation: 1332 Bayou Rd, St Bernard, LA 70085. Time: 11:30 show, 12:00 go\nCost: Bring $7 and a bottle of champagne. The freshest OJ in all the land will be provided by the hares. The hounds provide the bubbly 🍾🍾🍾","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10d9w00dm07kzmdmdmti5","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social @ All Relations Brewery","old_title_md5":"4915f8ee63372ba9ac53e4d08973edd8","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, January 24th. There's a new brewery in town, so we should check it out! Meet at All Relations Brewery (1401 Baronne St, New Orleans, LA 70113) at 6:00.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10dav00do07kzzazwhdff","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1642","old_title_md5":"d014480b5da1894a464f188db91a363d","set_hares":true,"hares":"CUM Muter ⚰ (trail), Little Red Head (beer), & We'd Eat Her (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1642. Date: Monday, January 27th\nHares: CUM Muter ⚰ (trail), Little Red Head (beer), & We'd Eat Her (food).\nLocation: Prelube at Ale on Oak, 8124 Oak Street.\nStart at the corner of Zimpel & S. Carrollton.\nTime: 6:00 show, 6:30 go. Cost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10dby00dq07kz69nrd7zh","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social @ Mid City Bulldog","old_title_md5":"6101df06962809f33a64ac325a49e9a9","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, January 31st. Meet at Mid City Bulldog (5135 Canal Blvd, New Orleans, LA 70124) at 6:00.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10dd800ds07kzeipuucdw","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1643 – Super bowl hash","old_title_md5":"e352aa050f92b0b8b8e3649a2eac1418","set_hares":true,"hares":"Shitty Titties (trail & beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1643. Sunday, February 2nd. Super bowl hash! Hares: Shitty Titties (trail & beer)\nLocation: Start & on-after will be at Shitty's house. Address: 2104 Mesa Via, Harvey, LA 70058\nTime: 2:30 show, 3:00 go\nCost: $6. Pot luck style on after at Shitty's house to watch the game. Bring food (to share) and beer (for you) for on-after.\nTrail is pet friendly, but they'll have to stay outside at on-after.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10dec00du07kzedworg4v","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social @ Parleaux Brewery","old_title_md5":"686360d5669e4130325d7bec0f13f5c1","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, February 7th. A bunch going on this night, one central meetup location to start the evening. Meet at Parleaux Brewery (634 Lesseps St, New Orleans, LA 70117) at 6:00. Full Moon is having a trail this evening that will include watching the Krewe of Boheme -- their prelube is also Parleaux.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10dfd00dw07kztocn3k3n","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social","old_title_md5":"407eba5d773eb12237a79479de1f9081","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Saturday, February 8th. Hang out and watch Krewe du Vieux roll through the Marigny! Location: The beer truck is between charters in Royal on HomerPlessy Street a.k.a. press Drive at NOCCA.\nTime: The beer truck will get there around 4:00pm, and the parade starts at 6:30. Cost: $10 buy in if you want hash beer.\nhttp://www.kreweduvieux.org/parade.html","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10dgd00dy07kzg9bz13si","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1644 – Hash to follow","old_title_md5":"fe2d72b84ec0c92ce10cc3bdaad9576a","set_hares":true,"hares":"Yank my Doodle","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1644. Sunday, February 9th. Rock 'n Roll Marathon, Red Dress water station! Wear your finest red dress attire and have a blast passing out water to the runners! Hash to follow. Hare: Yank my Doodle. Location: on Esplanade about 2 blocks on the river side of Broad. Look for folks wearing red dresses. Time: 6:30am. Cost: free if you help with the water station, $6 if you arrive after 8:00am. Hash at 11:00.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10dhb00e007kzgnht5r2y","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – Choose your own adventure","old_title_md5":"2f72e29a77325b0abd782b0dff5f8a50","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, February 14th. Choose your own adventure!\nOption 1: Meet up with the usual Valentine's Day/Single's Awareness Day crew at Finns (3701 Banks St, New Orleans, LA 70119) at 6:00.\nOption 2: Meet up at Family Gras at Clearview Mall (4436 Veterans Memorial Blvd, Metairie, LA 70006) at 4:00. For more info on the music lineup that night: https://www.visitjeffersonparish.com/events/festivals/family-gras/entertainment/","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10dic00e207kz6mgzq482","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1645 – Barkus Hash --- the hash is going to the dogs","old_title_md5":"85ae8bc70f258a090dfcb5cde3d1a4ee","set_hares":true,"hares":"Came Upon Me (trail, food, and beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1645. Barkus Hash --- the hash is going to the dogs! Hares: Came Upon Me (trail, food, and beer). Location: 1401 Lafitte Ave, New Orleans, LA 70112.Time: 11:00 show, 11:30 go. Cost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10djh00e407kz7qdhru8j","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Mardi Gras Madness","old_title_md5":"e60acfd969ebf3696c5b2100e7e638ef","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Mardi Gras Madness!!!\nDay 1: Friday, February 21st. Meet at the Rusty Nail at 4:00pm. Cost is $15 for just this event or $25 for both days of Mardi Gras Madness. The cost on this day covers beer and food, but you can always buy cocktails and such at the bar if you want to. We'll hang out in the courtyard at the Rusty Nail for a while, then meander over to the parade route to drink more and catch some beads!\nThis event is NOT dog friendly.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10dkf00e607kzl5ydg4tm","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Mardi Gras Madness – NOH3 Run #1646","old_title_md5":"c937253bcc3c720e2c92c09df39cd694","set_hares":true,"hares":"Came Upon Me (trail, food) & Shitty Titties (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Mardi Gras Madness!!!\nDay 2: Saturday, February 22nd. NOH3 Run #1646\nCost is $15 for just this event or $25 for both days of Mardi Gras Madness.\nHare: Came Upon Me (trail, food) & Shitty Titties (beer).\nLocation: Duncan Plaza Time: 10:00 show, 11:00 go.\nThere will be a costume contest during circle, so dress to impress! 3 Categories: best male, best female, best group. Following circle, we'll walk to the parade route to catch the parades --- will be standing near Union & St. Charles. This event is NOT dog friendly.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10dli00e807kzaeugknrl","set_title":true,"title":"Come support Crescent Shiggy's Bacchus Bash – Exact","old_title_md5":"f6dacdcd8d05830599cb5cc0d50034b6","set_desc":true,"description":"Sunday, February 23rd.\nCome support Crescent Shiggy's Bacchus Bash! 9:00am through the end of Bacchus. $20 gets you donuts, beer, mimosas, potluck style food to share, beer, and other goodies. Exact location TBD that morning. This event is NOT dog friendly.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10dmg00ea07kz6gv1swt6","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social @ the corner of Airline and N","old_title_md5":"8a859aec96d293218c9355d99fb0a54d","set_hares":true,"hares":"CUM muter & Spotted Dick (trail), Why Does It Burn (food), & Hitachi Topic (beer). 3:00 show, 3:30 go","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Saturday, February 29th. Meet up at Gennaro's (3206 Metairie Rd, Metairie, LA 70001) at 6:00 after the Swaggart Hash!\nInfo on the Hash:\nThe Jimmy Swaggart hash! Hares: CUM muter & Spotted Dick (trail), Why Does It Burn (food), & Hitachi Topic (beer). 3:00 show, 3:30 go. Meet at the corner of Airline and N. Arnoult in Metairie. $10 hash cash.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10dnn00ec07kz149rmvzu","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1647","old_title_md5":"d87da5fc80ea3833cb1b35e4494db0c1","set_hares":true,"hares":"Messiah & David Blow Me (trail), Shitty Titties (beer), & C.U.M. (food