olada (food)\nLocation: the end of Banks by the railroad tracks by the cemeteries\nTime: 6:00 show, 6:30 go\nCost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10gbh00ji07kznvpnicwp","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social","old_title_md5":"d244419e12f4581ec76603df97032e51","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, April 9th. Come on out to Step Brothers Bar and Grill (4971 W Napoleon Ave, Metairie, LA 70001) for a good time! Social starts at 6:00pm. - Bring your mask and wear it like you do at restaurants.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10gci00jk07kz8kf1kvgy","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1698","old_title_md5":"82f6716fffd14d4ede4228ec5f3bfa1b","set_hares":true,"hares":"OCR & Spotted Dick (trail), & Saved by the Bush (food and beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1698. Monday, April 12th.\nHares: OCR & Spotted Dick (trail), & Saved by the Bush (food and beer)\nLocation: Meet at intersextion of Huey P Long & First Street, next to the Gretna Rivershack (714 1st St, Gretna, LA 70053). The city doesn’t charge for parking after 5:30 PM\nTime: 6:00 show, 6:30 go\nCost: $7\n- If you're participating in the Youth Run NOLA 504k, both the walkers and runners trails will be long enough to count for your mileage.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10gdh00jm07kznij2m0b2","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – Even the craft beer is $3 or less","old_title_md5":"1a6947613d9efe94bb308365d49d1435","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, April 16th. Come hang out at Ernst Cafe ( 600 S Peters St, New Orleans, LA 70130) and drink some of the most affordable beer in all the land! Even the craft beer is $3 or less 😯\nPer the current rules:\n- Bring your mask and wear it like you do at restaurants","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10gei00jo07kzpvv0yg72","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1699","old_title_md5":"2c04d5b4d4f0300f8e5f5e4b842eb2fa","set_hares":true,"hares":"Lil Red Head & Weiner Breath (trail), Shitty Titties (beer), & Kneez To Please (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1699. Sunday, April 18th.\nHares: Lil Red Head & Weiner Breath (trail), Shitty Titties (beer), & Kneez To Please (food)\nLocation: Leo Benewell Playspot at Tchoupitoulas and Pleasant.\nTime: 12:00 show, 12:30 go\nCost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10gfl00jq07kza8v09k04","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – There's a happy hour before 6","old_title_md5":"bc72731e508190af998dbd4990865011","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, April 23rd. Come on out to Brewsky's -formerly Tarpon Joe's- (2205 David Dr, Metairie, LA 70003) and have some fun! Social starts at 6:00pm. There's a happy hour before 6:00 if you need to pre-lube on the cheap. - Bring your mask and wear it like you do at restaurants. *** Full Moon trail starting in the empty lot next door at 7pm! ***","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10ggq00js07kz9a3l3jc0","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1700 – Da hash is gonna celebrate","old_title_md5":"28b76e36ce31a42ec41e226768a117c5","set_hares":true,"hares":"Bent Ova Board & Cums on porpoise-eee (trail), MM (beer), & MM (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1700. Da hash is gonna celebrate! Come join us for the 1700th run and stick around for a crawfish boil at da pool afterwards. Rego is capped at 75 people!\nFollow the link below for more info on how to rego. Sunday, April 25th.\nHares: Bent Ova Board & Cums on porpoise-eee (trail), MM (beer), & MM (food)\nLocation: Wally Pontiff Playground (1521 Palm St, Metairie, LA 70001)\nTime: 11:00 show, 11:30 go\nCost: $20\nhttp://www.neworleanshash.com/crawfish.htm - Not dog friendly\n- Cost is $20 no matter what time you get there. Whether or not you drink beer. Whether or not you eat crawfish. - No early birds to the pool and crawfish. You can head over there when circle's done. - No skinny dipping in the pool.\n- When the party's over, GTFO!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10ghr00ju07kzvslt4gbs","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social","old_title_md5":"96abc50ab9270740be66d6127518abbd","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, April 30th. Come on out to JB's Fuel Dock (126 S Roadway St, New Orleans, LA 70124) and enjoy an evening by the water. Social starts at 6:00pm. - Bring your mask and wear it like you do at restaurants.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10gjz00jy07kzu71y04d7","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social","old_title_md5":"4e3391ad34648f8af5f3b4b318418580","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, May 7th. We're gonna have a low key, pool party social at Piston Penis' house this week. We've got some leftover beer and food, but not a ton. - Time: 5:00pm-10pm\n- BYOB if you want something particular or if you wanna have beer when the keg runs out. - Bring a snack to share if you want to. - Bring a chair if you want guaranteed seating. - No skinny dipping\n- No pets\n- No kids","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10gkv00k007kzl1g5o88g","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1702","old_title_md5":"a19c88ba5af968d2a7acefe611aeed3e","set_hares":true,"hares":"Spotted Dick & Peter Teaser (trail), C.U.M. (food), & Shitty Titties (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1702. Monday, May 10th. It's the Peter Teaser and Buttless birthday hash! Hares: Spotted Dick & Peter Teaser (trail), C.U.M. (food), & Shitty Titties (beer)\nLocation: The hash fountain (across the street from Ralph's On The Park, 900 City Park Ave, New Orleans, LA 70119)\nTime: 6:00 show, 6:30 go\nCost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10glw00k207kz7dfcy2gj","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social","old_title_md5":"2bb9150037b9d45295c0d7469320cb0b","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, May 14th. Come on out to Grits (530 Lyons St, New Orleans, LA 70115) and watch some hot, sweaty runners stumble their way into the bar. Social starts at 6:00pm. - Bring your mask and wear it like you do at restaurants.","old_desc_md5"