and will make its way into the Quarter. Social will start at 3:00 at Marie's Bar and Kitchen (2483 Burgundy St, New Orleans, LA 70117) to hang out and watch the \"festivities.\" It's a short walk/stumble from the bar to the route. If you're interested in joining in on the ride, join their Facebook page for more info: https://m.facebook.com/groups/135070029863460","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10h5r00ko07kzybfey7qg","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1707","old_title_md5":"37bc69b6d0c037d4d3780c23edb4caae","set_hares":true,"hares":"Hitachi Topic (trail), C.U.M. (beer), & Bent Ova-board (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1707. Monday, June 14th.\nHares: Hitachi Topic (trail), C.U.M. (beer), & Bent Ova-board (food)\nLocation: Wisner and Zachary Taylor, under the bridge\nTime: 6:00 show, 6:30 go\nCost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10h6y00kq07kzgodzuyuv","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – Even the craft beer is $3 or less","old_title_md5":"c00cbab552c007eb4158b922828daa7e","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, June 18th. Come hang out at Ernst Cafe ( 600 S Peters St, New Orleans, LA 70130) and drink some of the most affordable beer in all the land! Even the craft beer is $3 or less 😯\nSocial starts at 6pm.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10h8700ks07kzg6ik4m83","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1708","old_title_md5":"ea7278adcfb23c24ec432ae8925aea9a","set_hares":true,"hares":"Cums on porpoise-eee (trail), Shitty Titties (beer), & Gooey Blow (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1708. Monday, June 21st.\nHares: Cums on porpoise-eee (trail), Shitty Titties (beer), & Gooey Blow (food)\nLocation: Irby Field Parking Lot next to City Putt (33 Dreyfous Dr, New Orleans, LA 70119)\nTime: 6:00 show, 6:30 go\nCost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10h9i00ku07kz0ifrrupl","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – You can even run if you want to","old_title_md5":"3f5b68294ef21e13f70fdd89c9d6a8eb","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, June 25th. Come on out and enjoy some cold beer and good food! You can even run if you want to 🏃‍♀️🏃‍♂️\nMeet at Mick's (4801 Bienville Ave, New Orleans, LA 70119) at 6:00. Full Moon trail starts at 7:00 if you want to do a trail.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10haf00kw07kzjxd2rusc","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1709 – The 2nd Anal Popeye on da Best Bank Hash","old_title_md5":"90854e9b1449fa93f3ec01d2efb583ba","set_hares":true,"hares":"CUM muter ⚰️","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1709. Monday, June 28, 2021. The 2nd Anal Popeye on da Best Bank Hash!\nGet cha glow sticks, ya Hawaiian Punch & ya contraband and head over to the Westbank ya heard me!!!\n6 PM Show/ 6:30 PM GEAUX!\nHare: CUM muter ⚰️\nBeer hare: Spotted Duck\nFood Hare: Weiner Breath\nStart: corner of Huey P. Long Avenue & Second, at the Jefferson Memorial\nOn After: Gretna Depot\nHash cash: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10hbn00ky07kzgrfaclwg","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social @ Stepbrothers Bar and Grill","old_title_md5":"3b35bebf10816fc5d100c7bfd03ef5d0","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, July 2nd. Meet at Stepbrothers Bar and Grill (4971 W Napoleon Ave, Metairie, LA 70001) at 6:00. Good food, cheap beer, and vintage music videos!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10hcn00l007kzr48p02z6","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1710 – Independence Day hash and bbq","old_title_md5":"d9679cf1253ee3b890563cdf650de9b8","set_hares":true,"hares":"Hitachi Topic (trail), Yank My Doodle (beer), & C.U.M. (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1710. Sunday, July 4th. Independence Day hash and bbq!\nHares: Hitachi Topic (trail), Yank My Doodle (beer), & C.U.M. (food)\nLocation: Corner of Moss and Dumaine\nTime: 10:00 show, 11:00 go\nCost: $15\n** There will be a short trail followed by a BBQ at the bayou. Fireworks, lawn games, floats, SUP, kayaks are all encouraged so bring them if you got em! **","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10hdp00l207kzlpx150o1","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – Let's celebrate Christmas in July","old_title_md5":"738a326912d48849dc64685419f8d445","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, July 9th. Let's celebrate Christmas in July! We know you've been naughty and always get coal from Santa, so we're giving out the best gift there is --- free beer! NOH3 will have a bar tab set for certain beers, so cum celebrate and drink til the tab runs out. Meet at 6:00 at Snake and Jake's Christmas Lounge (7612 Oak St, New Orleans, LA 70118).\nIf you're feeling especially festive, join in on the costume contest! Prizes for winners, joy for spectators. Ho ho ho! 🎅","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10hev00l407kzkm3siee2","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1711 – but Running of the Bullshit hangover hash is","old_title_md5":"017aba996af2b59308bf43a66cc05e46","set_hares":true,"hares":"Swiss Cheeks, Turtle Dick (trail) Yank My Doodle (","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1711. Sunday, July 11th.\nRunning of the Bulls may not be happening this year in its full running glory (this year it is a Saturday night fiesta party due to city restrictions)... but Running of the Bullshit hangover hash is! (& hangover hash for those of you doing MOMS BALL PARTY too) 💃🏻🍻👣🍷 Swiss Cheeks 14th analversary of hashing.... hashing since the first Running of the Bullshit Hash in 2007!! 15th-ish Anal Running of the Bullshit Hash 💃🏻🍷👣🏃🏻‍♀️🏃🏻‍♂️🍻\nSunday, July 11th\n3pm show, 3:30 go\nHares: Swiss Cheeks, Turtle Dick (trail) Yank My Doodle (beer hare), Slick (food hare nom nom Spanish Paella rice dish) Dress in the Running of the Bulls theme white attire with red sashes/accessories Start: grassy area across from Cooter Brown's on corner of St Charles & Carrollton Cost: $10 Sangria made by Swiss Cheeks 💃🏻🍷\nMargaritas compliments of Cums on Porpoise eee thank you! 🍸 ON ONNN! 🏃🏻‍♀️🏃🏻‍♂️🍻🍷💃🏻👣","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10hfu00l607kz6mqp8v9q","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social","old_title_md5":"7b7f0f650216886131e6e117ee274e13","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, July 16th. Come on out to JB's Fuel Dock (126 S Roadway St, New Orleans, LA 70124) and enjoy an evening by the water. Social starts at 6:00pm.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10hh100l807kzvqtd2q9c","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1712","old_title_md5":"e678e7be46c70054f081d386ccb8ef03","set_hares":true,"hares":"Bent Ova-board (trail), Shitty Titties (beer), & We'd Eat Her (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1712. Monday, July 19th.\nHares: Bent Ova-board (trail), Shitty Titties (beer), & We'd Eat Her (food)\nLocation: Shelter 1 on Lakeshore Drive Time: 6:00 show, 6:30 go\nCost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10hih00la07kzufru60h6","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – You can even run if you want to","old_title_md5":"b79467dfe722b0265206d0d56b8b03d7","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, July 23rd. Come on out and enjoy some cold beer and good food! You can even run if you want to 🏃‍♀️🏃‍♂️\nMeet at Lots A Luck Bar (203 Homedale St, New Orleans, LA 70124) at 6:00. Full Moon trail starts at 7:00 if you want to do a trail.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10hjk00lc07kzmqbkb0x3","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1713","old_title_md5":"531ad88c7fb72b3db67f5a2c23bd855e","set_hares":true,"hares":"Weiner Breath (trail), CUM Muter ⚰(food), & Yank My Doodle (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1713. Monday, July 26th.\nHares: Weiner Breath (trail), CUM Muter ⚰(food), & Yank My Doodle (beer)\nLocation: the hash fountain (across the street from Ralph's On The Park, 900 City Park Ave, New Orleans, LA 70119)\nTime: 6:00 show, 6:30 go\nCost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10hkm00le07kz90l2cqq7","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – Come enjoy some beer and food for charity","old_title_md5":"9c98e4c17c8e94024ac63ab610ce0cec","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, July 30th. Come enjoy some beer and food for charity! Social starts at 6:00 at Deutsches Haus (1700 Moss St, New Orleans, LA 70119). Proceeds of beer and food purchases benefit flood victims in Germany. Check out their FB event for more info: https://facebook.com/events/s/bier-and-brats-for-german-floo/901057950483551/","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10hm300lg07kzb3prd4od","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1713","old_title_md5":"48165b50eed2a6ac47092515e3d9cdf9","set_hares":true,"hares":"Piston Penis (trail & beer) & Boner Lisa (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1713. Monday, August 2nd\nHares: Piston Penis (trail & beer) & Boner Lisa (food)\nLocation: the first shelter at Wally Pontiff Playground (1521 Palm St, Metairie, LA 70001)\nTime: 6:00 show, 6:30 go\nCost: $7","old_desc_md5":null,"set_run":true,"run_number":null,"old_run":1713},{"id":"cmnf10hn400li07kzs3yg64tt","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – Indoor and outdoor seating available.","old_title_md5":"7053720d40696ab8b60bf88e6a517674","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, August 6th. Come check out some live music and down some adult beverages! This week's social is at The Pour House Saloon (3501 Jefferson Hwy, Jefferson, LA 70121) starting at 6:00. Live music starts at 8:00. Indoor and outdoor seating available.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10ho600lk07kzcdhfospk","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1714","old_title_md5":"d2314dc53c5af7ca80da2f5cb30d249a","set_hares":true,"hares":"Yank My Doodle (trail), Shitty Titties (beer), & Penis Colada (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1714. Monday, August 9th. Come kick off a week of red with the NOH3 Red Skirt Run!\nHares: Yank My Doodle (trail), Shitty Titties (beer), & Penis Colada (food)\nLocation: The Mint, AKA the New Orleans Jazz Museum (400 Esplanade Ave, New Orleans, LA 70116)\nTime: 6:00 show, 6:30 go\nCost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10hpd00lm07kz78z2s9p6","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1715 Saturday, August 14th – It's the Red Dress Run","old_title_md5":"a6acb6a29da91a3fa5193a1e9beb26fd","set_hares":true,"hares":"Deadcell (trail)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1715 Saturday, August 14th. It's the Red Dress Run!!!!\nHares: Deadcell (trail). Runners follow trail. Walkers do the regular RDR route. Location: Crescent Park (2300 N Peters St, New Orleans, LA 70117)\nTime: hare away at 10:00, pack away at 10:15\nCost: register in advance!\nhttp://www.neworleanshash.com/rdrsignup.asp","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10hrh00lq07kzy8b9ang1","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – Come hang out and support a local brewery","old_title_md5":"d62790c3be07e140633b7d3637d522f6","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, August 20th. Come hang out and support a local brewery! Meet at Oak St. Brewery (8201 Oak St, New Orleans, LA 70115) at 6:00. It's in Orleans Parish, so bring a mask and proof of vax or negative COVID test within the past 72 hours. If you don't have proof of vax or don't feel comfortable sharing it, they can bring a to-go beer out to you. Cool little brewery that started during COVID and is trying their best to make it through -- come check it out! BYO food. Dog friendly.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10hsn00ls07kzlefpl5tl","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1716 – Halfway to Mardi Gras","old_title_md5":"4ffd2820bef122b696f8919bf37dd35d","set_hares":true,"hares":"Saved by the Bush (trail), Spotted Dick (beer), & Just Corey (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1716. Halfway to Mardi Gras!\nDate: Sunday, August 22nd\nHares: Saved by the Bush (trail), Spotted Dick (beer), & Just Corey (food)\nLocation: Wisner Playground (4877 Laurel St, New Orleans, LA 70115) Time: 3:00 show, 3:30 go\nCost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10hts00lu07kzgjk7auvg","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social @ The Harbor Bar & Grill","old_title_md5":"a5cb0207a0671fc803a01aff1fb209d6","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, August 27th. Meet at The Harbor Bar & Grill (3024 17th St, Metairie, LA 70002) at 6:00. Beer and burgers.... what more could you need????","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10hv300lw07kzo8aruwoc","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – Pool party social at Casa de C.U.M.","old_title_md5":"eb96207e7e4e94714343e363cc987d5a","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, September 10th. Pool party social at Casa de C.U.M.! Party starts at 6:00. BYOB and a snack to share. No kids.\nNo pets.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10hwf00ly07kzp9ycn5uy","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1717 – Halfway to St. Patrick's Day","old_title_md5":"562f6d3e1b7be75856b5cc7d6a288ba1","set_hares":true,"hares":"Pop Her Smurf (trail), Yank My Doodle (beer), & C.U.M. (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1717. Halfway to St. Patrick's Day!\nDate: Monday, September 13th.\nHares: Pop Her Smurf (trail), Yank My Doodle (beer), & C.U.M. (food)\nLocation: intersection of Conti & N. Anthony (by the cemeteries)\nTime: 6:00 show, 6:30 go\nCost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10hxa00m007kzuzhwfhgx","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – You can even run if you want to","old_title_md5":"7e1e23ae81f56068c315152c19d1a536","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, September 17th. The theme of the week has been Halfway to St. Patrick's Day, so we're gonna drink like the Irish! You can even run if you want to 🏃‍♀️🏃‍♂️\nMeet at Holy Ground (3340 Canal St, New Orleans, LA 70119) at 6:00. Full Moon trail starts at 7:00 if you want to do a trail.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10hy900m207kzrzfr5754","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1718","old_title_md5":"4c7945e57d0abc87b773363a9bfc67f3","set_hares":true,"hares":"Cock Ringer (trail & food) & Yank My Doodle (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1718.\nDate: Monday, September 20th. Trail followed by on after at Cock Ringer's house -- food & pool party!\nHares: Cock Ringer (trail & food) & Yank My Doodle (beer)\nLocation: Laketown Park (at the end of Williams Blvd by the lake)\nTime: 6:00 show, 6:30 go\nCost: $7\n- BYO chair\n- We'll have some beer at on after, but bring extra if you want a lotta beer 😉","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10hzc00m407kzehcbogs7","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social @ Winston's Pub & Patio","old_title_md5":"1e6f18d38dd6a5c0aea9edcfd4c760e4","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, September 24th. Meet at Winston's Pub & Patio (531 Metairie Rd, Metairie, LA 70005) at 6:00.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10i0b00m607kz7co89pl6","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1719","old_title_md5":"3c4072fee6a8602365baffe3da2a9e1c","set_hares":true,"hares":"Bend Over Rover (trail & food) & Just Corey (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1719.\nDate: Monday, September 27th. Hares: Bend Over Rover (trail & food) & Just Corey (beer)\nLocation: 322 S. Telemachus\nTime: 6:00 show, 6:30 go\nCost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10i1a00m807kzfywe099j","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social @ JB's Fuel Dock","old_title_md5":"86565a777e5f2d8cef20388abb511976","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, October 1st. Come enjoy a chill night with pizza and beer by the water. Meet at JB's Fuel Dock (126 S Roadway St, New Orleans, LA 70124) at 6:00. Happy hour ends at 6pm, so get there a lil early if you want some cheaper drinks 😉","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10i2a00ma07kzpz4zd4y9","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1720","old_title_md5":"bc26965eaaac063a6938de62bf627b58","set_hares":true,"hares":"Just Joey & CUM Muter⚰ (trail), Kneez to Pleez (food), & Cavity Search (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1720.\nDate: Monday, October 4th. In honor of Just Joey, please wear your craziest shorts!\nHares: Just Joey & CUM Muter⚰ (trail), Kneez to Pleez (food), & Cavity Search (beer)\nLocation: the Mardi Gras fountain by the lakefront (on Lakeshore Dr. just east of Canal Blvd.)\nTime: 6:00 show, 6:30 go\nCost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10i3i00mc07kznypzx4lb","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social @ Mid City Yacht Club","old_title_md5":"3fe098d47e3b1760be48cf1ee400fa52","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, October 8th. Hangin' out, drinkin' beer, and a nearby porch concert🎶\nMeet at Mid City Yacht Club (440 S St Patrick St, New Orleans, LA 70119) at 6:00. If you're in the mood for a porch concert, wander on over to 217 S. Bernadotte for some live music from Concrete Confetti. Check their FB event for more info: https://facebook.com/events/s/concrete-confetti-porch-party/918743962073972/","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10i4l00me07kzazuhv8ix","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1721 – It's a Zombie hash","old_title_md5":"256ce7e0e3053b7956aa868ed0209630","set_hares":true,"hares":"Butt or Balls & C.U.M. (trail), Surprise Squirt (food), & Shitty Titties (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1721. It's a Zombie hash! Dress like the undead and try to get some brain 🧟‍♂️\nDate: Monday, October 11th. Hares: Butt or Balls & C.U.M. (trail), Surprise Squirt (food), & Shitty Titties (beer)\nLocation: Bucktown Marina\nTime: 6:00 show, 6:30 go\nCost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10i5o00mg07kzx45710vl","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – Topcats are playing at 6","old_title_md5":"adb219a8894638f78f099d4266ae2387","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, October 15th. Friday, Friday, Friday!! Hash social is at the Gretna Amphitheater on da river! Topcats are playing at 6! What is the price you say? Free!! Thanks Gretna! Come on out an join fellow Hashers! Right across the levee from the Gretna Rivershack! Beverages available for purchase or since it is outdoors you could bring your own!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10i6o00mi07kz83xcwexm","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1722","old_title_md5":"d471610ee9bdb89dd2c77711f25f7b1c","set_hares":true,"hares":"Bent Ova-board (trail), Just Corey (food), & Spotted Dick (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1722.\nDate: Monday, October 18th. Hares: Bent Ova-board (trail), Just Corey (food), & Spotted Dick (beer)\nLocation: Lakeshore Park (by Bayou St. John on the Wisner side)\nTime: 6:00 show, 6:30 go\nCost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10i7r00mk07kzw62z3bbi","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – Free beer at da Bayou","old_title_md5":"e88380d2c3733ef73cf269de6d9ab65a","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, October 22nd. Free beer at da Bayou! Bring a chair and a snack to share. Meeting along Bayou St. John across from the post office (501 Moss St, New Orleans, LA 70119).\nFull Moon will also have a trail starting VERY nearby. So you can bring your running shoes and get a run in while you're at it 😁","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10i8p00mm07kz5o3gcofr","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1723","old_title_md5":"9b66983efe5e46429960259ebcdfd7cc","set_hares":true,"hares":"Cums on Porpoise-eee & Swiss Cheeks (trail), CUM Muter ⚰ (food), & Just Corey (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1723.\nDate: Sunday, October 24th. Oktoberfest hash! Time to dust off your lederhosen and grab your favorite stein. Prost!\nHares: Cums on Porpoise-eee & Swiss Cheeks (trail), CUM Muter ⚰ (food), & Just Corey (beer)\nLocation: the Reunion Shelter in City Park Time: 3:00 show, 3:30 go\nCost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10i9v00mo07kzscodposa","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social @ Second Line Brewing","old_title_md5":"28e6f88a7e6bc71608a7977fc95ee658","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, October 29th. Come cheer on the Mid City Run Club Beer-a-thon! Meet at Second Line Brewing (433 N Bernadotte St, New Orleans, LA 70119) at 6:00. There's gonna be a food truck with fried chicken for sale as well.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10ib400mq07kzi3r0gtqz","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1724","old_title_md5":"9404ecf241fff23c2b8ba2d775f2b879","set_hares":true,"hares":"CUM Muter ⚰(trail), Bent Ova-board (food), & C.U.M. (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1724.\nDate: Monday, November 1st. Day of the Dead Hash 💀🌺💀🌺💀🌺💀🌺 CUM dressed in ya All Souls finest! Hares: CUM Muter ⚰(trail), Bent Ova-board (food), & C.U.M. (beer)\nLocation: Corner of Banks Street & S. Anthony Street (behind St. Patrick #1 Cemetery 👻)\nTime: 6:00 show, 6:30 go\nCost: $7 hash cash","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10ic700ms07kzcu01uyla","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – The hash goes to Oktoberfest","old_title_md5":"bf5b07e4e5c18ee51adaeac584595fca","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, November 5th. The hash goes to Oktoberfest! Meet at Deutsches Haus (1700 Moss St, New Orleans, LA 70119) at 6:00. Admission is $10 cash. Food and drinks for sale. Here's the website for more info: https://oktoberfestnola.com/","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10idb00mu07kzi84zlk0i","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1725","old_title_md5":"c24cd05e6869f4aebc805011259d5bbb","set_hares":true,"hares":"Hitachi Topic (trail), Butt or Balls & Just Nicole (food), & TBD (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1725.\nDate: Monday, November 8th. Hares: Hitachi Topic (trail), Butt or Balls & Just Nicole (food), & TBD (beer)\nLocation: John C. Bright Playground (Ney Rey Park, 3401 Cleary Ave, Metairie, LA 70002)\nTime: 6:00 show, 6:30 go\nCost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10iec00mw07kzjhgyqv3q","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – It's festival season again","old_title_md5":"1045e758dc966cd6c8a5104eb65d3346","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, November 12th. It's festival season again! Come on out to the Oyster Festival at St. Clement of Rome (4317 Richland Ave #3027, Metairie, LA 70002) for food and live music. Free to enter, buy food and drinks on site. Category 6 goes on stage at 8pm.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10igo00n007kzy9i1as3r","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1726","old_title_md5":"8a8dc8e134a44d1fd29cd8edb84e200a","set_hares":true,"hares":"Weiner Breath (trail), Kneez to Please (food), & Just Corey (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1726.\nDate: Monday, November 15th. Hares: Weiner Breath (trail), Kneez to Please (food), & Just Corey (beer)\nLocation: Samuel Square (2100 Napoleon Ave, New Orleans, LA 70115)\nTime: 6:00 show, 6:30 go\nCost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10ii400n207kzmn9ssscw","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social @ Oak St","old_title_md5":"f9f70052294426a40cc3dec36906b95d","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, November 19th. Meet at Oak St. Brewery (8201 Oak St, New Orleans, LA 70115) at 6pm. Indoor and outdoor seating, dog friendly, and BYO-food.\nFull Moon trail starting nearby at 7pm if you want to get a run in!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10ij800n407kzyw2kj3ue","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1727 – Hashgiving & Erections","old_title_md5":"a27cfd07763cf0ceb1a66e27382a47e6","set_hares":true,"hares":"Saved by the Bush & Pic of the Litter (trail), Shitty Titties (beer), & everyone else (food)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1727. Hashgiving & Erections! It's that time again --- time to stuff our faces and decide who's gonna run this circus next year. More details on Facebook. Hares: Saved by the Bush & Pic of the Litter (trail), Shitty Titties (beer), & everyone else (food)\nLocation: Start at corner of Belfort and Crete. On-After at C.U.M.'s house. Time: 11:69 show, 12:30 go\nCost: $5 if you bring a shareable dish, $15 if you don't","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10ikg00n607kzka7tvub4","set_title":true,"title":"BONUS TRAIL – Awooooooo","old_title_md5":"6ec87be1c19da4d55202e640eee15a64","set_hares":true,"hares":"Saved by the Bush and Drag Queen","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"BONUS TRAIL! Awooooooo!\nIt's time for the 2nd anal Wolfenoot pickup trail! 🐺\nA trail to celebrate the doggos. Location: The \"Disc golf parking lot\" on Harrison by Wisner Disc Golf Parking Lot\nhttps://maps.app.goo.gl/qXqCoBYJNUH6h8MN9\nHares: Saved by the Bush and Drag Queen Time: 6:00 show, 6:30 go\nCost: $5 --- if there's any money left over after beer is covered, it'll be donated to ARNO\n--- Bring a shareable snack that is dog friendly","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10ilp00n807kz1h9qxqpn","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social @ Step Brother's Bar and Grill","old_title_md5":"93ef287b194b91795c555255c4177280","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, November 26th. Come dance off your Thanksgiving calories at Club Steps! If you haven't been to a Video DJ night at Step Brothers yet, you're missing out. Meet at Step Brother's Bar and Grill (4971 W Napoleon Ave, Metairie, LA 70001) at 6pm. Music videos start later in the evening.","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10imr00na07kz8071ffwj","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1728","old_title_md5":"45f0125cc4cce14be505845aa5eb6e5d","set_hares":true,"hares":"Bent Ova-board(trail), CUM Muter ⚰ (food), & Yank My Doodle (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1728.\nDate: Monday, November 29th. Hares: Bent Ova-board(trail), CUM Muter ⚰ (food), & Yank My Doodle (beer)\nLocation: corner of Harrison & Milne (Iberia Bank on the corner)\nTime: 6:00 show, 6:30 go\nCost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10inp00nc07kz0tmia2p7","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social – Cheap beer for all the hashers","old_title_md5":"df6895345714b5305e6255fde41b9d87","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, December 3rd. Cheap beer for all the hashers! Meet at Ernst Cafe (600 S Peters St, New Orleans, LA 70130) at 6pm. Word around town is they're discontinuing the cheap beer at the end of the year, so get in on it while you can 🍻","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10iot00ne07kzfmlek4j5","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1729 – The second anal Toys For Twats Trail","old_title_md5":"f5543f87a7e74edcc42c10ac5e1ddea9","set_hares":true,"hares":"CUM Muter ⚰, Explosive Glitorus, Bent Ova-board,& Saved by the Bush","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1729. The second anal Toys For Twats Trail! And drinking practice at Mick's!\nDate: Monday, December 6th\nHares: CUM Muter ⚰, Explosive Glitorus, Bent Ova-board,& Saved by the Bush\nLocation: Mick's Irish Pub (4801 Bienville Ave, New Orleans, LA 70119).\nTime: 6:00 show, 6:30 go\nCost: zero dollars. Buy beer and food at Mick's. --- $5 raffle tickets for your chance to win a very sexy gift basket. CASH only and you must be present to purchase tickets and claim your prize. ALL PROCEEDS go to New Orleans Toys for Tots. CUM dressed in your tackiest Xmas or Misfit toy attire!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10ipx00ng07kz8fd6idhe","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Social @ Rendon Inn","old_title_md5":"e39916fbf420b3eefcb77e958877419d","set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Social... Friday, December 10th. Meet at Rendon Inn (4501 Eve St, New Orleans, LA 70125) at 6pm.\nFull Moon trail starting nearby at 7pm if you want to get a run in!","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10iqz00ni07kz8i2vv88p","set_title":true,"title":"NOH3 Run #1730","old_title_md5":"a51703f91b297dc409854c3d7430cc26","set_hares":true,"hares":"Cavity Search & Yank My Doodle (trail), Just Corey (food), & C.U.M. (beer)","old_hares_md5":null,"set_desc":true,"description":"NOH3 Run #1730\nMonday, December 13th.\nHares: Cavity Search & Yank My Doodle (trail), Just Corey (food), & C.U.M. (beer)\nLocation: parking lot at Audubon Park by Shelter #10 on (by the Audubon Clubhouse Café)\nTime: 6:00 show, 6:30 go\nCost: $7","old_desc_md5":null},{"id":"cmnf10isf00nk07kz1eb5sixq","